window.MONARCH_CHAPTERS=(window.MONARCH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Sparring Session","paragraphs":["Inside the training facility, there were multiple sparring platforms which allowed many battles to be conducted at the same time.","\"Students! Finally, the time has come for which you have been so eager. Today we will have a sparring session that you all were so excited about.\" Here, her own voice sounded more excited than the students.","That didn’t mean the students were not excited. They were also excited about this. But a few of them were more worried, just like Noah. He was worried about whom he would be paired up with.","Practice weapons in the training facility were made of wood and carbon fiber to make this class a little less painful for the students.","Noah didn’t mind fighting anyone... except the main cast.","But somehow luck was not on his side.","Unfortunately, he was paired up with Leonard.","Noah checked the notice he got on the academy mobile app. In just a few seconds, his opponent was chosen randomly.","’Guess... I have to give my all.’","Other battles had already started.","Some distance away from him, the protagonist Damien was fighting against Kaelan. And as expected, Kaelan was having a hard time against him.","While the female lead, or more like the female protagonist of this game, Lyria, was fighting against Arisha. Out of all female leads, she had a more major role. But what it was, he didn’t know.","Noah really wanted to watch their spar. Of course, it had nothing to do with their beauty or figures.","But currently, Aisha Willow was having the upper hand in battle.","While Emma was fighting against a student named Elijah, and so on.","Young students sparred against each other, bonding and enjoying themselves for a little while.","What about Noah? Yes, he was also standing on a sparring platform now.","In front of him stood a tall, muscular blonde-haired man. In his hand was a huge greatsword. Of course, not a real one, but a practice weapon.","’I guess it would have been better if the one fighting me was the female lead...’ Noah sighed in disappointment.","\"Hello Leonard! Long time no see!\"","Leonard didn’t say anything for a while, then nodded slightly. \"Yes. Long time no see, Noah. Let’s stop greeting and just fight.\"","The young man held the hilt of his greatsword tightly.","Noah was holding a practice sword. He got into a stance, raising his sword.","Leonard smirked and vanished from his position.","He had dashed towards Noah.","He was fast, fast enough that Noah couldn’t follow him. But Noah didn’t back down or get afraid.","Clang!","\"Argggh!\"","His sword met against the blade of the huge greatsword.","The force in that strike was so strong that Noah was slightly pushed back.","’How is he moving so fast with a huge sword?!’","The sparring for today was the first time. So they were only supposed to fight with weapons, without using any mana or magic.","Even those who heavily relied on magic, like some mages, were fighting with weapons.","It was necessary. Whatever profession one might have, they still needed to know how to use other weapons or skills, at least on basic levels.","But Leonard didn’t give Noah even a moment to think.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Another series of heavy strikes rained down.","Each swing of Leonard’s greatsword carried terrifying force. Even though it was a practice weapon, the sheer weight behind it made Noah’s arms tremble every time he blocked.","Noah gritted his teeth.","’He’s too fast... too strong...’","Leonard stepped in again, his footwork precise. He twisted his body and brought the blade down from above.","BOOM!","Noah barely managed to raise his sword in time. The impact echoed across the platform.","\"Argh!\"","His knees bent slightly from the pressure.","Leonard didn’t stop. He pulled back instantly and swung horizontally.","Noah ducked.","The blade whooshed past just above his head.","Before Noah could even stand properly.","Thud!","Leonard’s knee slammed into his stomach.","\"Ghh—!\"","Noah staggered backward, gasping for air.","Leonard didn’t chase immediately this time. He watched Noah with calm, sharp eyes.","\"You’re slow. Try to do better,\" he said coldly.","Noah wiped the corner of his mouth and smirked faintly. \"Is that so... well, I will try then.\"","Leonard’s eyes narrowed. In the next instant, he disappeared again. Noah’s pupils shrank.","’Left!’","Clang!","He barely turned in time to block. The impact pushed him sideways. Leonard rotated his grip and struck again from another angle.","Clang!","Then again.","Clang!","Noah was completely on the defensive now.","Each attack came from a different direction—above, side, diagonal. Leonard’s control over his weapon was terrifying.","Maybe if it was the old Noah, he would have lost instantly. But currently, Noah had been training diligently since he got transmigrated.","Noah tried to counter once. He pushed Leonard’s blade away and swung toward his torso.","But Leonard stepped back effortlessly. The attack missed.","A second later.","BAM!","The flat side of the greatsword slammed into Noah’s shoulder.","\"Agh!\"","Noah stumbled, losing balance. ’Damn it! I can’t even land a single hit!’","Leonard advanced again, not giving him space. Another downward strike. Noah rolled to the side this time.","BOOM!","The sword hit the platform, leaving a visible crack.","Noah quickly got up and dashed forward. ’If I stay defensive, I’ll lose for sure!’","He aimed for Leonardo’s side. A quick thrust. But Leonard reacted instantly. He twisted his body and parried.","Clang!","Then followed up with a kick.","Thud!","Noah was sent sliding back. His grip loosened slightly on his sword. His arms were shaking now. His breathing grew heavier.","’This guy... he’s on a different level.’","Leonard walked toward him slowly this time. He was not in rush. But complete control.","\"You’re trying,\" he said calmly. \"But it’s not enough.\"","Noah smirked again despite the situation. \"Yeah, I know that.\"","Leonard didn’t reply. He raised his sword. His physical strength and speed far surpassed Noah’s.","Then Leonard vanished again. This time, Noah couldn’t track him instantly.","’Behind—?!’","A presence behind him. But Noah predicted it too late.","BOOM!","The blade struck his back. \"ARGH!\" Noah was sent crashing forward, falling hard onto the platform.","THUD!","His sword slipped from his hand and slid a few feet away. He tried to push himself up.","But his arms gave out for a moment. Leonard stepped forward and placed the tip of his greatsword near Noah’s neck."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Cafeteria Scene","paragraphs":["Next day.","The sparring session went better than Noah had expected. He was not ashamed of his performance.","Nor did any other student try to mock him.","’When will the first event occur? I don’t have a single idea nor anything that can warn me.’ As always, Noah, with no friends, was eating alone in the cafeteria once again. The loner was getting tired of it.","Many students were chattering with their friends while enjoying their lunch.","He took a chicken steak and chewed on it.","Noah was without a doubt a foodie, and free food always tasted better than anything else to him.","’Should I join some Adventurer Guild?’ Noah wondered, remembering how he could join it.","In this world, there is a Hero Association in the human empire.","Everyone is categorized in a similar way as monsters. Those at the initial stage, such as Dormant Core (Low), are considered Rank F-.","Noah did have an idea about those things. But the Hero Association does not accept anyone below Rank C-, which corresponds to Low Refined Core. On the other hand, the Adventurers Guild allows individuals to register even if they are still at the Dormant Core stage.","Noah then started to drink soup.","The Aurelian Imperium Empire has the Hero Association, which operates under the Imperial Family. It only accepts individuals who have reached the Refined Core stage. These individuals are considered Rank C heroes.","Above that are Rank B and up to Rank SS, which corresponds to the Sovereign Core. No one could become a hero under the Refined Core stage, which was currently Noah’s potential limit.","Heroes who reached Rank B were allowed to form their own adventurer guilds. The Adventurers Guild also ranks awakeners in the same way. However, they allow Dormant Core individuals to join as Rank F adventurers.","The exact rank depends on the stage of their core: Low corresponds to F-, Mid to F, and High to F+.","He started to think about it more deeply. ’But even if I want to join it.. are we students allowed? Well, I will try to find out later.’","Noah wanted to find a way to break his limit, his potential. But he had no idea how.","Just then he heard some sound of plates or dishes falling on the floor.","Clang!","But Noah didn’t pay any attention to that, thinking it might be some student who dropped their plate.","But soon a commotion started in the cafeteria.","\"How dare a lowly commoner like you touch me? You even dirtied my clothes!\" An arrogant voice echoed in the cafeteria.","\"I’m really sorry!\" a familiar female voice came after that.","\"Sorry? You think you could go away after doing this? Your sorry will not clean my coat!\" The male voice who was yelling arrogantly also seemed familiar.","\"You really have some nerve to do this to our Sir Edward!\"","\"We should teach a lesson to this lowly commoner!\"","The other two male voices were also familiar.","Noah finally looked in the direction where this commotion had occurred.","A few students were standing near them, so Noah couldn’t see it clearly. But he knew who those three male voices belonged to...","’Those three idiots again?’","Those three were the third-rate young master Edward.","His two underlings, the glasses-kun Testu and fatty boy Richard.","’Interesting... is this... is this that first event... where a commoner lady is getting bullied by a young master and then saved by the main protagonist? Where he beats those arrogant nobles? Then a short arc of teaching the young master a lesson starts?’","Noah’s eyes brightened with excitement.","He got up from his seat, went towards the counter, and took more chicken steaks. He needed to enjoy this scene while eating something nice.","\"Hey, what do you think you are doing?\"","Finally, amidst this chaos, a strong voice echoed in the cafeteria. It was confident and aggressive.","Noah could already guess who it belonged to!","’Damien! Fuck, Damien actually appeared! This was just as I expected!’","Noah moved towards the scene fast.","Pushing aside a few other students, he finally saw it.","The three students named Edward, Testu, and Richard were standing on one side.","While opposite to them was Damien. He stood tall with a calm and indifferent expression.","Behind him was a familiar woman. Her black hair was neck-length. She was wearing big round glasses. Her eyes were black. She had soft fair skin and a cute face.","Noah raised one of his eyebrows. ’Mary?’","He knew that girl from the washroom.","’Now this is interesting!’","Though Noah didn’t remember seeing her name on the character list of the game, there were many side characters or hidden heroines.","He didn’t pay much attention to side characters while reading it.","Edward was standing with an ugly expression. He was clearly not happy with the intervention of another person.","\"Boy... I don’t know who you are... but if you want a safe life in the academy, then don’t mess with me.\"","\"You just tried to slap her... that was wrong. How could you attack someone in the academy? If that is not enough, you should be ashamed of yourself for trying to hit a girl.\"","’Shit... it seems I missed the scene where he blocked Edward from hitting Mary.’ Noah was sad that he was late.","But still, this wouldn’t end easily.","He chewed on his steak while enjoying the show.","Munch","Munch","Noah was standing in front of the surrounding crowd.","Meanwhile, Damien’s hazel eyes narrowed dangerously.","\"Hahaha! You both are just lowly commoners. Do you know who I am?\"","Damien didn’t say anything for a while, like he was thinking about something deeply. \"Are you... a spoiled child?\" Finally he spoke.","\"Pfft—\" someone nearly burst into laughter, but controlled themselves.","While Noah smiled widely.","Edward’s expression turned slightly red in shame. His expression was full of rage.","\"How dare you! Trying to make fun of me? Do you know who my father is?\"","\"You commoner, you have made a big mistake by insulting our Sir Edward.\"","\"Now you will pay for this, you commoner.\"","\"Please don’t fight... it was my fault,\" Mary said from behind with a worried expression.","\"Damien, you don’t need to go against them to help me out.\"","Damien turned towards her. A gentle smile appeared on his handsome face. \"Don’t worry. I am doing what is right. You were just walking with your plate of food and by mistake collided with him. You even apologized to him... yet the way he treated you and tried to slap you was wrong.\"","\"Don’t worry. I won’t let anything happen to you.\" He turned and looked at the trio with cold eyes."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Challenge!","paragraphs":["Damien cold glared made the trio flinched.","\"Hmm. Yo-you thunk looking at me with those eye will make us fear you?\" Edward forced an arrogant smile.","\"Boy...tell me your name...you really have gotten yourself into a bad situation.\"","\"Haha! He is going to pay for this.\" Richard laughed while looking at Damien.","\"They should know their places before confronting people like us.\" Testu pushed his bridge of glasses with his index finger.","\"My name is Damien Ashworth.\" Damien ignored then and said in voice was loud. Echoed in hall.","Students started to chatter more after hearing his name.","Many knew about his name. He was rank 1 afterall.","But all of it was useless in front of idiot young master.","Edward aslo went silent. His smile never wavered.","Noah who was looking at the scene was more curious now.","’Is he acting brave...or just don’t know the name of rank 1...’ even Noah couldn’t tell what was going in the head of that guy.","\"Damien..hahaha! Mark my words..your bad time had started after offending me.\" Edward said with small arrogant tone.","But this time, testu and Richard...those two were slightly nervous. It seems like those two actually know about Damien.","At this point even other main characters had came and started watching the commotion.","Kaelan,Leonard, Lyria, Emma and Arisha. Yet no one intervene. Rather they watch with amusement.","Damien was clearly a commoner. That much Noah knew about him. Yet because of his rank, he was able to get those high ranking noble kids as his friends.","Both Leonardo and Kaelan were from high ranking family. Their family were higher ranking compared to Edawards. Yet they continued to enjoyed the scene.","Emma was looking at the scene with excitement. Similar to Noah.","Leonardo was grinning.","Lyria was smiling worriedly hoping it won’t escalate.","While Arisha was looking at them with indifferent. She was a commoner herself. So she was obviously on Damien’s side.","Munch!","Munch!","Meanwhile Noah kept eating his food.","’Why this is not getting further....they should fight ...or atleast have a duel.’","Noah was hoping for that kind of development.","He put the last steak in his mouth. It was slightly raw. Not cooked well. Still Noah used his strong teeth to chew on it hard.","\"Arrmhh!\" Finally he tear the meat and started to chew on it more loudly.","Munch!","But suddenly Edward and other two underling looked at him.","Even Damien and Mary followed then and stare at him.","Soon others also followed their gazes. Then saw Noah standing there. He alone was eating food while the scene was getting heated..","He first glanced at Edward’s side....then move towards Damien’s side.","He even checked behind him. There was no one standing now.","Gulp!","Gupling down the meat. He smile gently at them..","\"Haha! Don’t mind me please. You guys should carry on what you were doing.\" He waved his hand and told them to continued.","But for some reason Edward’s eyes gleamed. Soon his forced smile turned into real strong arrogant one.","\"Hahaha! I finally got you Noah!\" He walked towards Noah.","\"I have been waiting to meet you...I have not forgot the first day...the thing you had done to me and my unde– I mean my friends.\"","The other two guys, Richard and Edward also smile creepy and stand behind Edward.","\"This time we won’t go easy on you.\"","\"You are going to pay for what you have done!\"","This time Noah was baffled.","What’s with this development? This was not how things should progress.","After getting confronted by Damien. Edward should challenge him for duel. Where he was beaten by Damien easily.","That’s how it was supposed to go. At least that’s how things go in usual academy storyline.","\"Listen Edward. I already got punishment from Instructor Morgana. There is no need to make more scenes. We shouldn’t fight agaisnt each other.\" Naoh tried to stop them with calm smile.","But inside he was cursing out. Not to this trip. But to Damien. ’What the hell? Why isn’t that guy saying anything? Watching everything from there like he was an audience not protagonist. He just intervene to help a woman..but when it comes to man his not even trying to help me!’","Noah was really angry on him.","The problem was which person in right mind would try to help someone like Noah.","\"Hey you? Are you scarred now? Afraid that we will beat you this time...last time was sudden that’s why you were able to hit us...but not this time.\"","Edward exhaled.","\"Naoh Eldritch! I challenge you for a duel! If you have even little bit of dignity and not some scared cat...then accept it.\"","No Noah blinked this time.","It was true that Noah actually have no dignity. But the man in front of him was just another extra. A third rate villain.","Defeating him won’t be a problem. He already fought him and know that Edward was on same level as him. If not weaker.","Testu adjusted his glasses and looked at Noah with a mocking smile.","\"Oh? So now the great Noah is trying to run away?\"","Richard laughed loudly from behind Edward.","\"Hahaha! Where did all your confidence go now? On the first day you were acting so tough!\"","Testu nodded. \"Yes, yes. Attacking three people alone. And now suddenly you want peace?\"","Richard crossed his arms and smirked. \"Looks like someone is scared.\"","Edward folded his arms, looking at Noah with an arrogant smile.","\"What happened, Noah? Scared that I will beat you this time?\"","Noah didn’t reply immediately. ’Well this will be interesting fight. It will be helpful for my own growth.’","He calmly picked up the last piece remained steak from his plate which was not cooked well.","Munch.","He took a big bite. Everyone around was silent, watching him.","Munch.","Testu frowned. \"Is this guy serious right now?\"","Richard looked annoyed. \"He’s eating in the middle of this?\"","Noah swallowed the food, then licked a bit of sauce from his finger.","Then he looked at Edward and smiled brightly.","\"Yes. I accept your challenge.\"","For a moment there was silence. The trio were clearly surprised. They didn’t expect him to agree so easily.","Testu blinked. \"He... accepted?\"","Richard frowned. \"That was too easy...\"","But Edward’s surprise quickly turned into a wide, arrogant grin.","Then he started laughing loudly. \"Hahahaha! Good! Very good, Noah!\"","He pointed at him. \"Now that’s what I wanted to hear.\"","Edward turned around dramatically.","\"Follow me. We are going to have the duel right now.\"","He began walking away from the cafeteria like a villain who had already won.","Testu pushed his glasses up and smirked at Noah before following Edward.","Richard cracked his knuckles and followed behind them with a grin.","And just like that, they left the scene.","Noah sighed.","’How did this even turn into this...’","He put his empty plate on a nearby table and started walking behind them.","Leaving behind a completely confused cafeteria.","Damien, Mary, Leonardo, Lyria, Emma, Kaelan, Arisha, and many other students were still standing there, stunned.","They didn’t understand what had just happened.","Everything had changed in a 180-degree turn.","They had completely forgotten the reason why the quarrel even started in the first place.","---","[A/N: Don’t forget to add my other novel \"The Smiling Death\" to you library. And give it a try by reading it. If you love fun and comedy novels. Then you will love that one]"]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Duel Against Arrogant Young Master (1)","paragraphs":["Inside the training facility, the same place where yesterday Noah and the others had their sparring session.","This time, no instructor was with them, but for students to have duels against each other or challenges, there were always staff members appointed to the training facility at the training ground.","Joran, who was one of the working staff, came with them. He was a middle-aged man with dark brown hair and gray eyes.","\"Take this and wear it on your hands, both of you.\" Joran handed Noah and Edward black-colored bands.","\"The duel would be concluded if one defeats the other by holding a sword at their neck or by any other clear victory condition.\"","\"And if it doesn’t end like that, and you continue to fight, then at one critical hit or when your health becomes low, you will be automatically teleported outside the ring.\"","Noah and Edward listened to him silently.","Testu and Richard were standing slightly away from them.","They were near the sparring platform to watch their duel.","Noah and Edward put on those bands.","\"So, you two are ready?\"","\"Yes, I am.\"","\"Yes.\"","Both of them climbed onto the platform, standing on opposite sides.","Just then, some figures entered the sparring hall.","Noah’s gaze went in their direction, only to widen his eyes in shock.","’Why are they here?’","They were none other than Damien and the other main characters.","Lyria, Arisha, Kaelan, Emma, and Leonard. All of them were here. Following them quietly was Mary.","Mary and Damien being here was understandable, since they were having a quarrel earlier. But Damien’s friends? Why were they here?","\"Well... whatever. They must be curious about this battle,\" he muttered under his breath.","---","Meanwhile, on the main characters’ side.","Lyria and the others had no interest in watching the spar of low-ranking students, since both Noah and Edward had lower ranks.","But because of Damien’s insistence, they followed him.","Mary was the reason why he offended Edward, so she also followed them.","With a curious expression, Leonard observed Noah, his left hand rubbing his chin.","\"Who do you think will win this duel?\" Leonard asked as he observed Noah. Curiosity was clearly written on his face.","With a bored expression, Kaelan scoffed from beside Leonard, his blue eyes uninterested.","\"Who cares? They are just weaklings. No matter who wins, it doesn’t matter.\"","With a light chuckle and a relaxed expression, Emma spoke.","\"Well, I am here because Damien said so. Otherwise, I would not have bothered coming here.\" As usual, she had tied her brown hair in a single braid that rested against her shoulder.","With an indifferent expression and her golden eyes glued to the sparring platform, Arisha spoke calmly.","\"I won’t deny it... I wanted to watch this battle. Mostly to see Edward get beaten. Though Noah is no better than Edward... I will be on his side for today.\"","With a gentle smile and calm expression, Lyria spoke softly. \"Come on, guys. Since we are here... we should enjoy it.\" Her pink eyes then turned towards Damien.","\"What do you think, Damien? Do you think Noah can defeat Edward?\"","With a thoughtful expression, Damien looked at the sparring platform before answering.","\"Well... I have seen him fighting Leonard... he is not strong... but I don’t know anything about Edward. If he is stronger than Noah or not... so let’s see... even though I don’t like Noah... this time I hope he wins.\"","Then Damien turned towards Mary with a calm expression.","\"Do you think the same?\"","With a slightly nervous expression, Mary nodded softly.","\"Yes... I hope he wins.\" She then glanced at the man who was preparing for the fight, who was dragged into this for no reason.","---","Back to Noah and Edward.","This time Noah chose a spear. A silver-colored spear appeared in his right hand. The blade on top was blue in color. The bottom of it rested against the metal floor.","The spear oddly matched Noah’s appearance. His soft snow-white hair and ocean-blue crystal-like eyes. He was truly handsome.","On the opposite side, Edward pulled out his greatsword.","’Nice!’","Noah had sparred with Leonard yesterday, and he used a greatsword. Now Edward was using the same weapon. And obviously, his sword skills would be low compared to Leonard.","Joran stood in the corner of the platform, in the center area.","\"When I say start... you will start fighting.\"","Both Edward and Noah took their stances.","Joran raised his hand slightly and looked at both of them.","\"1...\"","Both Noah and Edward tightened their grips on their weapons.","\"2...\"","They leaned forward slightly, muscles tensing.","\"3... Start!\"","The moment the word left Joran’s mouth, both Noah and Edward kicked off the ground and dashed toward each other.","Clang!","The greatsword met the spear with a loud metallic sound. The impact echoed across the training hall.","Both of them pushed against each other for a moment before jumping back.","Edward attacked first.","He raised his greatsword and did a powerful vertical slash.","Noah quickly lifted the shaft of his spear and blocked the attack using the middle part of the spear like a staff.","Clang!","The force was heavy, but Noah held his ground.","’He’s stronger than I thought.’ Noah thought with narrowed eyes.","Edward immediately followed with a horizontal slash aimed at Noah’s waist.","Noah quickly ducked under the blade, feeling the wind pressure of the sword pass just above his head.","At that moment, Noah thrust his spear forward.","Edward twisted his body slightly and the spear barely missed his shoulder.","They separated again.","Edward clicked his tongue. \"Not bad.\"","Noah didn’t reply. His eyes were focused and calm.","’But not enough to beat me.’","Edward then smirked and suddenly his body released a faint aura.","Mana.","He started using mana to reinforce his body.","Seeing this, Noah also focused.","He could feel the mana moving from his core to all over his body, flowing through his veins, strengthening his arms and legs.","His grip became stronger. His legs felt lighter. His vision sharper.","Edward dashed again, this time much faster than before.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Their weapons clashed again and again.","Edward swung his greatsword heavily, each attack carrying powerful force.","Noah used the spear to deflect, block, and redirect the attacks rather than stopping them directly.","Edward did another heavy vertical slash.","Noah stepped to the side and used the spear shaft to redirect the blade downward.","Edward immediately spun and did a wide horizontal swing.","Noah jumped back just in time, the blade barely missing his chest.","The distance between them increased again. Both of them were breathing slightly heavier now.","Edward smirked. \"Let’s see how long you can keep defending.\"","He rushed forward again."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Easy Duel","paragraphs":["The duel continued as both Noah and Edward circled each other slowly, their eyes locked.","Edward exhaled, and then suddenly mana surged around his body more intensely than before. A faint aura wrapped around his arms and greatsword.","Then he changed his stance.","He pulled his greatsword slightly back, and his expression became serious.","Then he moved. He stepped forward and swung his greatsword in a diagonal slash, but this time it was different.","A faint arc of mana left the blade as he swung.","Slash.","Noah’s eyes widened slightly, and he quickly moved his spear to block. Mana wrapped around his own spear.","Clang!","Even though he blocked the sword, the mana slash still pushed him back a step.","Edward smirked. \"This is my family swordsmanship. Let’s see how long you can last.\"","Edward attacked again.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","Each swing of his greatsword now carried mana blades that flew a short distance from the sword. Noah was forced into defense, constantly blocking and dodging.","He only knew basic spear techniques, slightly better than complete beginners, but nowhere near Edward’s swordsmanship.","Edward didn’t just attack with those slashes.","The next moment, Edward dashed forward again, but this time his movement was different. More controlled, more precise.","Noah blocked with his spear, but he immediately felt the difference. The attack was not just strong. It was refined.","So Noah did the only thing he could. He defended and avoided.","He stepped back, deflected a vertical slash, twisted his body to avoid a horizontal swing, then blocked another mana slash with the shaft of his spear.","Clang!","Clang!","Clang!","Edward’s attacks became faster and more aggressive.","Noah’s arms were starting to hurt from blocking the heavy greatsword again and again.","’I can’t win in close combat like this...’","Noah suddenly jumped back, creating distance between them.","Edward smirked. \"Running away now?\"","He held the spear in his right hand and lifted it above his shoulder. His left leg moved forward and bent at the knee, his body leaning slightly back.","Mana started gathering around the spear. More and more mana wrapped around the spear shaft and blade.","The spear began to glow blue because of mana.","Edward noticed this and narrowed his eyes.","\"What are you—\"","But before he could finish, Noah threw the spear with all his strength.","The spear shot through the air like a bullet, glowing blue, cutting through the air with a sharp whistling sound. The spear went straight toward Edward.","But Noah didn’t stop there.","’Okay... let’s do it.’","The moment he threw the spear, he kicked off the ground and dashed forward, following right behind the spear.","Edward looked at that with a smirk. He raised his greatsword and swung it with full force.","Clang!!!","The greatsword struck the spear and knocked it away, sending it spinning across the platform.","But just behind the spear, Noah appeared, since he was running behind the spear.","Edward immediately tried to swing his sword at him. But at that exact moment, something was forming in Noah’s hand.","Edward didn’t notice at first. There was something going on in Noah’s hand. Mana gathered rapidly in Noah’s right hand.","Then, an ice sword formed in his hand instantly. A blade made entirely of ice. It was ice-blue in color. Clean and crystal clear.","Noah swung it immediately.","Clang!","Edward’s greatsword collided with Noah’s ice sword. Edward’s eyes widened in shock.","\"A sword?!\" He was confused as to where it came from. Did he pull it from a storage ring?","He tried to step back. But he couldn’t move. His foot was stuck. He looked down for a split second.","Ice had formed around his foot, freezing it to the ground.","Noah’s eyes filled with excitement. \"Got you!\"","Edward tried to curse, but before he could react—","Noah’s left fist moved. He had already formed an ice gauntlet around his fist.","The fist, covered with an ice gauntlet, slammed into his right cheek.","Boom!","Noah, with a wide smile, had put all his strength into that punch.","’That felt nice..’, he thought.","The impact was so strong that Edward’s head snapped to the side and his grip loosened on the greatsword.","Crack!","The ice sword in Noah’s hand suddenly shattered into pieces. It was Noah who dismissed it, not because of the impact with the greatsword.","Noah didn’t stop. He sidestepped quickly and moved his right hand fast toward Edward.","Edward tried to move, tried to defend. But he was too late.","A partially formed ice gauntlet appeared on Noah’s right fist. He was not able to fully form it, but it was still enough.","Boom!","Noah punched Edward directly on the chin.","Edward groaned in pain, his head snapping back.","Noah then completely lost control and started beating him without giving him any chance to recover.","His right fist was now fully covered with ice, forming a gauntlet.","He was laughing loudly now. \"Haha! Where did your arrogance go now?!\"","\"Man! This is more fun than I had thought!\" Noah excitedly said those words while punching Edward.","Punch!","He punched Edward’s face. He punched his cheek.","Punch!","His stomach.","Punch!","His ribs.","Edward couldn’t defend properly. His greatsword slipped from his hand and fell to the floor with a loud metallic sound.","Noah kept punching him again and again, his ice-covered fists slamming into Edward’s body.","Students watching from outside were completely shocked.","Especially Testu and Richard. They had horrified expressions on their faces. They didn’t expect the fight to turn like this.","Just then, the staff member acting as referee shouted loudly,","\"Stop! Match over! Winner is Noah Eldritch!\"","Noah stopped mid-punch.","\"Tch!\"","Though Noah was enjoying it, and even laughing like crazy, that didn’t mean he had gone crazy. He was still in his right mind.","Edward’s body fell to the ground, groaning in pain. The ice that was freezing his foot also shattered into small pieces.","Noah stood there, breathing heavily, looking down at Edward, who was lying on the floor defeated.","\"Well... that was a fun fight,\" he said with a satisfied smile.","He walked toward the fallen spear and picked it up. Then he put it inside the storage ring."]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Trying To Get Along","paragraphs":["\"Sir Edward!\"","\"Sir Edward!\"","Two voices shouted as the match ended.","Testu and Richard ran onto the platform toward the fallen Edward.","\"Argh!\" He was still groaning in pain. His face was covered in bruises given by Noah. Blood was coming out of his nose and mouth. With Testu’s help, he sat upright.","\"Take him to the infirmary,\" Joran said from his place. Both Richard and Testu nodded, helping Edward stand up.","\"Cough!\" Edward coughed as more blood came out of his mouth. Then he glared at Noah with hatred.","\"Y-you won’t get away with this!\" Richard also glared at Noah, giving him a threat.","\"This is not over yet!\" Testu did not remain silent either.","Noah looked at them with a wide smile on his handsome face, which looked somewhat evil.","\"Scram off!\" What came out of his mouth was nothing good.","Testu and Richard flinched at his words, then took Edward toward the exit of the training facility.","Joran glanced at Noah. \"I thought you would lose control and keep beating him even after I ended the duel. Well, I guess you didn’t lose control in excitement. Good.\" Saying that, Joran left.","Noah then glanced to the other side, where the main characters were standing. They were watching him with interest. There were other students as well who had come to watch his battle, but they were just extras. Nothing important.","Noah got off the sparring platform and walked toward them. Everyone watched him as he got closer.","Finally, he stood in front of Damien. They were similar in height. Noah’s blue eyes met Damien’s hazel eyes.","They remained silent and continued to stare at each other as if it were some kind of staring competition.","\"You were the one who provoked that Edward. Why the hell did I have to fight him?\" Finally, Noah broke the silence in irritation.","Everyone looked at him in surprise, as if taken aback.","Damien blinked a few times. \"What? I did not provoke him.\"","\"You did not? You were the one who tried to save Mary. It was your responsibility to fight him. When he came to me, you should have intervened, just like you did for Mary. Or did you do that because she is a cute woman?\"","\"What?\" Mary, who was beside Damien, blushed slightly. She adjusted her glasses. Looking at the floor.","\"Pfft.\" Kaelan nearly burst into laughter. After all, his rival was getting accused of a very weird thing. It was funny for some reason.","\"Hey, what are you saying?\" Damien question with frowned. Then continued, \"Well, you see Edward turned to you suddenly, trying to provoke you and you are a man. You could handle that yourself. So I didn’t interfere \"","\"Tch.\" Noah clicked his tongue. He knew why Edward had suddenly turned his attention to him. After hearing Damien’s name, the trio had actually become afraid. Though Edward did not show it on his face, Noah knew that Edward was strong against the weak and weak against the strong.","So when he saw Noah, he changed his target so he would not get embarrassed in front of the other students in the cafeteria, after acting high and mighty only to become afraid after knowing Damien was rank one student.","Emma looked at Noah with a disapproving expression, not liking how he was talking to Damien.","\"Guys, calm down. No need to escalate things.\" Lyria walked in, trying to calm them down, not wanting another scene here. Her blonde hair swayed gently.","Noah looked at her from up close. She was even more beautiful from near.","\"You really fought well, Noah. I am happy that you taught him a lesson.\"","\"Thank you, Lyria.\" Noah turned his tone soft and respectful. A gentle smile appeared on his handsome face.","\"It is my pleasure to get a compliment from someone like you. Even though I am lower ranked, you are still saying that to me. It is a big thing. It shows how kind you are.\"","Once again, the others were taken aback.","Even Arisha, who did not show much reaction, raised her eyebrow.","He had just been talking in an irritated and disrespectful tone to Damien. Suddenly he changed completely.","\"Haha, no problem. I just said what I think.\" Lyria smiled at him gently. Her soft pink eyes were warm toward Noah. It was not just for him. Lyria was kind to everyone.","\"Well anyway, you really fought well against Edward,\" Leonardo joined in with a hungry grin.","\"Thanks, buddy,\" Noah replied casually with the same smiling face.","Of course, it was not like their thoughts about Noah had changed or anything. Kaelan was still looking down on Noah from his place.","Emma had an annoyed face, clearly not wanting to talk to him.","Arisha was silent. She already did not like nobles much, except Leonardo, Lyria, and a few others.","While Lyria was just kind. It was her nature to talk gently to others.","Then Noah turned toward Mary, whose cheeks were slightly flushed.","\"Hello, Mary. Hope you are okay. Do not worry, I beat the hell out of Edward. If comes back to you...just tell me.\" Noah grinned while looking at her.","Which made her flinch.","\"Well, thank you for that.\" She nodded her head, clearly showing nervousness.","Noah got confused by her reaction. \"Why are you nervous?\"","Damien frowned and looked at Noah like he was an idiot.","Arisha who was standing beside Lyria shook her head. She ran her hand through her violet hairs, \"Of course most people would be afraid and nervous after watching you laugh like a crazy man while beating Edward. Do you know how you looked at that time?\", She said as if it were the most common thing.","\"I agree. You were looking like a madman, for sure.\"","Noah coughed after hearing them. A slight flush formed on his cheeks.","\"I do not know what you guys are talking about. Well, whatever.\"","He looked at Damien and extended his hand.","\"You might already know, but I will introduce myself again. My name is Noah Eldritch. Hope we can get along well.\"","Damien stared at his hand, then his face. He was contemplating. He knew exactly what the old Noah had done, but the one in front of him looked very different from the rumors.","Still, he extended his hand and shook it with Noah’s.","With calm expression he said, \"Yes, I will be looking forward to it.\""]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: VR-Battle","paragraphs":["Through the hallways, a group of students was walking. Their shoes clicked against the marble floor. They were talking to each other while every other student kept glancing at them.","It was not every day to see a group of strong and also gorgeous-looking people walking together.","\"By the way... what did you think about Noah? Don’t tell me you really think he’s changed?\" The one who asked this question was none other than Emma.","\"We can’t tell that yet. But he’s acting better compared to how he used to be,\" Leonardo replied while walking beside her.","\"Well, I think he looks kind... I mean not when fighting. But while talking, he does look like a good guy,\" Lyria said with a slightly confused expression.","\"Oh, Lyria! You are too kind. And that makes you think everyone is good. But that’s not true.\" Emma shook her head while trying to explain some common sense to her friend.","\"You are beautiful. I bet that was the reason why he talked so politely to you! No other reason.\"","\"Tch! As much as I know, he never talked politely to anyone his age. No matter how beautiful they were,\" Kaelan clicked his tongue while saying what he knew. Then he continued, \"Also, why are you even talking about him? There’s nothing special about him.\" His tone became slightly irritated.","Damien, who was in the middle, just smiled at his reaction.","\"I have to say... He is handsome... too handsome,\" Arisha spoke indifferently. Her expression was as calm as ever.","But those words shocked everyone.","Aisha Willow, who acted like an ice queen, who didn’t like noble men... actually said Noah was handsome.","That really shocked them.","\"Now that’s new...\"","\"Oh! Oh my goodness. Arisha, don’t tell me you have a crush on Noah! Or is it love at first sight?\" Emma was beyond shocked. Her face looked utterly horrified.","She turned to Emma. \"The fuc—cough! I mean, what are you talking about? Me? A crush on Noah? That’s not possible. I just said it because he really is handsome, nothing else.\" She turned her face in another direction while walking with an annoyed expression.","\"Okay. Let’s drop the subject. No reason to talk about it,\" Damien finally spoke, trying to change the subject.","\"Then what should we talk about?\" Lyria asked with a cute tilt of her head.","\"...You know that next week we are going to have a VR fight against another class. This is not an exam, but it will be a kind of practical session for us to fight in a group. To learn teamwork.\"","\"Yeah... but we will get to know the date of this fight, or say battle, on Monday,\" Emma rubbed her chin while thinking about how to fight against the other class.","\"That battle is going to be fun,\" Leonardo said with a wide grin.","\"You think so? Well, I am kind of looking forward to it myself,\" Damien was also excited for the class battle.","\"Team battles are always messy,\" Kaelan said, crossing his arms over his chest. \"Most people don’t know how to fight in formation. Everyone just rushes forward like idiots.\"","Leonardo grinned. \"That’s because most people think they are the main character.\"","Emma nodded. \"Team battles are not about being strong alone. Positioning, timing, support, defense... everything matters. If one person messes up, the whole team loses. And if it’s about the whole class against another class, then it will be harder. We need to fight together with 100 students.\"","Lyria looked a little worried. \"I’ve never fought in a proper team battle before... What if I mess up?\"","\"You won’t,\" Damien said calmly. \"Team battles are about coordination. Even if you make a mistake, your comrades will cover for you.\"","Emma pointed at Damien. \"Exactly. That actually makes group battles more exciting.\"","Arisha, who had been quiet for a while, finally spoke, \"VR battles are also different from real fights. People take more risks because they know they won’t actually die.\"","Leonardo smirked. \"Which makes it more fun.\"","Emma rolled her eyes. \"You just want to fight strong people.\"","\"Of course,\" Leonardo replied without hesitation. \"What’s wrong with that?\"","Kaelan laughed arrogantly. \"You’re going to charge first and get surrounded. I can already see it.\"","Kaelan glared at him. \"I’m not that stupid.\"","\"You are,\" Emma and Leonardo said at the same time.","Lyria giggled softly.","Damien just shook his head while smiling.","---","The evening slowly settled over Novaris City, painting the sky in shades of orange and purple. The busy streets were still filled with people, lights, and noise. But far away from the main roads, in one of the unknown corners of the city, there was a narrow alleyway where no one walked.","The alley was dark, damp, and silent. Water dripped from broken pipes, and trash bags were piled near the walls. The only light came from a flickering street lamp at the entrance of the alley.","Heavy footsteps suddenly echoed in the silence.","A man was running through the alley, stumbling again and again as he tried to keep moving forward. His breathing was heavy and uneven.","\"Haa... haa... haa...\"","His clothes were torn, and his body was covered in blood and wounds. A deep cut ran across his shoulder, and blood had soaked his sleeve completely. His face was pale, and sweat mixed with blood dripped down from his chin.","The man looked around in panic while running. His hands were shaking as he pulled out his mobile device. A communication device used by academy staff.","\"No signal...?! Why is there no signal?!\" he muttered in panic.","He was getting hunt down by someone. And just then no communication device of his was working.","He don’t even know why someone was trying to kill him.","He was just an ordinary worker at Academy. Appointed in cleaners section. But now his life was on line.","He tapped the screen again and again, trying to contact the academy or emergency services, but the device showed No Network.","Even the emergency signal machine attached to his belt wasn’t working.","\"T-This is impossible... Signal jammers...?\" he whispered in fear."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: The Puppet","paragraphs":["He tapped the screen again and again, trying to contact the academy or emergency services, but the device showed No Network.","Even the emergency signal machine attached to his belt was not working.","\"T-This is impossible... Signal jammers...?\" he whispered in fear.","The man was Petrick, an ordinary worker at Novaris Academy.","He had black hair, now messy and covered in dust, and green eyes filled with fear.","He kept running deeper into the alley, limping slightly due to his injuries.","\"I just need to reach the main road...\" he muttered. \"If I reach the main road, I will be safe...\"","But at that exact moment, something suddenly flew through the air.","A sharp sound cut through the silence.","Slash!","Before he could even react, something sliced through his left leg.","For a split second, he did not even understand what had happened.","A deep cut appeared on his left leg.","Blood gushed out like a fountain.","\"Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaahhhhhhh!!!\"","He fell to the ground immediately, screaming in unbearable pain. His body rolled on the dirty alley floor as he grabbed his thigh, trying to stop the blood, but it was useless. Blood kept pouring out between his fingers.","\"M-My leg!! My leg!! Aaaahhh!!\"","His screams echoed through the empty alley, but there was no one to hear him. No one to help him.","He tried to crawl forward using his hands, dragging his body across the ground, leaving a long trail of blood behind him.","\"H-Help... somebody help... please...\" he cried, his voice trembling and weak.","He heard footsteps behind him.","Tap","Tap","Tap","They were slow, calm and unhurried footsteps.","His entire body froze.","The footsteps were not of someone running, not of someone in a hurry, but of someone calmly walking toward him.","Fear filled his eyes. He slowly turned his head back. From the darkness at the end of the alley, a figure emerged.","A man wearing a dark hooded cloak walked toward him slowly. His face was hidden under the hood, and only his chin was visible. His hands were inside the cloak, and his steps were steady and calm.","The hooded man stopped a few steps away from him and looked down at the bleeding man lying on the ground.","Petrick trembled. \"W-Who are you...?\" he asked in a shaking voice. \"W-Why are you doing this to me...?\"","The hooded man did not reply immediately.","He just looked at him silently for a few seconds.","Then he spoke in a calm, cold voice. \"What have you done?\" he paused for a few seconds and then continued. \"You have done nothing wrong.\"","\"Then why?.. Why are you trying to kill me?\" Petrick asked with fear.","\"Oh you poor soul~ I do not have any animosity with you. It is just that I wanted the body of any weak staff member from the Academy. And tonight I found you. You were just the unfortunate one. It could have been anyone, any colleague of yours, but sadly you were the only guy I found today.\" The man walked towards Petrick.","Tap","Tap","Tap","\"Wait! Do not come any closer to me..\" Petrick panicked. He dragged himself forward. The blood trail continued on the road.","His breathing turned faster. His heartbeat increased.","But the unknown man grabbed his head.","The palm covered his whole head and tightened around it.","\"Arrrghh!\" Petrick stopped crawling. Tears formed at the corners of his eyes as the grip tightened on his forehead.","\"Alright... goodbye~\"","\"Arrrggghhhhhhhhhh!\" The man screamed in pain. His hands and legs trembled violently.","His eyes were wide open in pain and horror. Slowly the light in his eyes faded.","He stopped screaming. His body stopped moving. Petrick was dead. Or was he?","The man loosened his grip from Petrick’s forehead.","The body fell forward like some lifeless corpse.","The man crossed his arms over his chest.","\"Well it is done.\"","Soon Petrick’s body started to move. It slowly sat upright. The man took out a small crystal bottle, opened its lid, and threw the light green transparent liquid on the wounded part. The deep cut on Petrick’s left leg started to heal.","After the healing was completed, Petrick’s lifeless body stood up like a puppet.","Then it turned around and silently walked away from the unknown man without even glancing back.","The man watched his back with a smirk hidden beneath his hood.","\"Now I just need to wait for a few days. Then I can start it...\"","Soon the smirk vanished.","The man remained standing there for a while. Then suddenly he disappeared.","---","Back at the academy, inside the training facility.","Noah had been training for hours now. What he was trying to learn was quite interesting. He was enjoying it.","He was in the shooting area. His right hand was extended. In front of him was a spear made of ice, floating in midair.","\"Nice... now let’s try to control it...\"","Noah had never tried to do this before, but after training for a few days, he noticed something more about his ability.","His Ice Creation ability not only allowed him to create things from ice, but also allowed him to manipulate the ice he created with his ability.","When he was fighting that bear monster and was on the verge of death, he had extended his hand and an ice shard appeared in front of his hand.","At that time, he did not think much about it. But now, when he thought about it deeply, he noticed something.","He could cast a spell named Ice Shard. But he clearly did not use that spell while fighting that monster. Because to cast spells, a magic circle was important. There was no magic circle when he used those ice shards at that time.","He had unknowingly formed those ice shards using his Ice Creation ability, and yet he shot them through the air toward the monster.","Which indicated that he could actually control and move whatever he made using Ice Creation.","Past Noah never bothered training. He never tried to discover more about his ability.","Currently, he was learning that same thing. And he was right.","After creating anything with his ability, he needed to use more mana on it and make it float. Then he could move it at his own will.","\"But it takes a lot of mana... but well, it is bearable for a short time.\"","The ice spear in the air shot forward with intense speed, cutting through the air with a whistling sound.","Thud!","It hit the target perfectly.","The tip of his ice spear thrust perfectly into the middle of the shooting target.","\"Ha... hah...\" Noah breathed heavily. He was tired.","His extended hand fell down to his side. The ice spear soon cracked and shattered.","\"Not bad...\" Noah muttered with a small smile.","He was enjoying his time while training.","Not knowing what danger was approaching him and others."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Mana Theory","paragraphs":["It was Saturday.","In the blink of an eye, the week was coming to an end, with the holiday being tomorrow.","\"Yawn~\"","Currently, Noah was in his class, sitting on the back bench while listening to the lecture.","At the front of the class was the ever beautiful Morgana Celestine.","She stood in front of the large digital board, wearing her usual elegant black outfit that perfectly fit her figure. Her long hair fell over her shoulders, and her sharp eyes scanned the classroom.","\"Today,\" she began, crossing her arms, \"we will start with Mana Theory.\"","Some students immediately straightened their backs. Some looked bored. Some looked excited.","\"You all might already know some basics about mana,\" she continued, \"but since this is the first time I am teaching mana theory to you, we will start from the very beginning.\"","She turned and tapped the board. A diagram appeared showing a human body with a glowing core near the stomach.","\"First question,\" she said, turning back to the class. \"What is mana?\"","The class became quiet for a moment. Then a student in the front row raised his hand.","\"Yes,\" Morgana said.","\"Mana is the energy that allows us to cast magic,\" the student replied.","Morgana nodded slightly. \"Correct, but incomplete.\"","She walked slowly across the classroom as she continued speaking.","\"Mana is the fundamental energy of this world. It exists everywhere. In the air, in the earth, in water, in living beings, everywhere. A person absorb mana into their bodies and store it in their mana core. From there, they circulate mana through their mana channels and use it to cast magic.\"","’That was a small but very simple explanation.’","Noah had gotten most of the memories of past Noah. And he, being good for nothing, still had studied these basic things.","Then why was the instructor teaching those things again?","It was simple. Since no matter how common some knowledge might be, there always exist some people who don’t know anything about it.","She drew another diagram on the board showing mana flowing from a core through channels into the arm.","\"We could reinforced our bodies with mana. Which helps us to move faster and increase our physical strength. But for now we will focus on magic.\"","Then she continued.","\"To cast magic, mana must be moved in a specific pattern. If the pattern is wrong, the spell will fail. If the mana flow is unstable, the spell may explode in your face.\" She looked at the class seriously. \"Which I hope none of you are stupid enough to try.\"","Some students laughed nervously. Noah leaned back in his chair, listening carefully.","Morgana continued, \"Now, second question. What are the methods to cast magic?\"","This time, Lyria raised her hand.","\"Yes.\"","\"There are several methods,\" Emma said. \"Magic circles, runes, hand signs.\"","Morgana nodded. \"Good.\"","She turned to the board and wrote those words.","\"Magic circles, runes and hand signs. These are the most common methods to cast magic. Among them, magic circles are the most efficient and most widely used method. They are stable, precise, and allow complex spells to be cast.\"","She drew a circular diagram filled with symbols.","\"Runes are usually carved on weapons, armor, or objects. They are used for enchantments and passive effects. But they can be used for support magic or small spells.\"","She drew a few rune symbols on the board.","\"Hand signs are faster but less stable. They are mostly used in combat when there is no time to draw a magic circle.\"","\"Symbols are similar to runes but simpler. They are often used in quick casting or support magic.\"","She then turned back to the class. \"Now we move to elemental affinity.\"","At this, many students became more attentive.","\"Mana allows a person to control elements. Most people are born with an affinity toward one element. Some people have multiple affinities, but that is rare.\"","She wrote on the board again, this time the names of all basic elements.","\"Fire, water, wind and earth. These are the basic affinities. Most people belong to one of these four elements.\"","\"Ice, gravity, sand, sound and some more. These are rare elements. Not many people have them, but they are not extremely rare either. You will definitely meet people with these abilities.\"","Noah quietly looked at the word Ice on the board. He had an affinity towards ice. Actually, there were many rare elements. Shadow, mist and even poison.","Then Morgana paused for a moment before writing again.","Then she wrote another list. The classroom became quieter.","\"These are not natural elements,\" Morgana said slowly. \"They are conceptual elements.\"","Some students looked confused. Noah narrowed his eyes. He perfectly knew about those elements and who had affinity towards them.","Someone raised their hand slowly. \"Instructor... what are conceptual elements?\"","Morgana looked at her and replied, \"Natural elements control the world around us. Fire burns, water flows, wind moves, earth supports. They are part of nature.\"","After listening to that, Noah suddenly thought about Lyria, who had Light affinity.","While Damien also possessed light affinity, he had multiple elements.","Then his eyes turned to Kaelan, who had affinity towards darkness.","Then he focused on the lecture again.","She paused and then continued in a slightly more serious tone. \"But conceptual elements are different.\"","She tapped the board where Light and Darkness were written. \"Light controls energy and life. Darkness controls death and souls. And some more unique things.\"","The classroom became completely silent.","Even Damien, who had been leaning lazily in his chair, was now listening very carefully.","\"People with conceptual elements are extremely rare,\" Morgana continued. \"And their abilities are often far more dangerous and complicated than natural elements. Darkness element users can even perform necromancy.\"","She turned around and looked at the entire class with her amethyst eyes.","\"So do not think magic is just about throwing fireballs and making wind blades. Mana is the foundation of everything. If your mana control is poor, your magic will always be weak no matter what element you have.\"","She then smiled slightly.","\"And that is why, starting next week, we will begin mana control training.\"","Many students immediately groaned. Morgana’s smile widened slightly.","\"Yes,\" she said. \"You are all going to suffer.\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: What Just Happened?","paragraphs":["\"Now, I know many of you might already have learned some basic spells. While there may be some rare number of students who haven’t learned any spells.\"","Noah nodded at her words. Learning basic spells was not a big deal. But there might be a few people who had never learned any of that, since magic scrolls cost a lot of money. Though there did exist some daily-use magic which even many commoners knew.","\"Okay. For both of you, those who haven’t yet learned any spells or those who have learned spells, I will personally give you all some basic spells according to your elemental affinity.\" Morgana took out a lot of scrolls from her dimensional bracelet as she said that.","She put them on the desk. It seemed she had come prepared. Those scrolls mostly belonged to the Academy. They were expensive.","’But again... the Academy is filthy rich. The whole city basically belongs to the Academy. So it’s no big deal.’","After that, she started distributing those spell scrolls among the cadets who were still sitting.","Noah got up when his name was called. He calmly walked towards her and took the scroll.","After distributing those scrolls, she looked over the class. \"Try to learn it. Practice it tomorrow the whole day, since it’s Sunday.\"","\"Also, if you don’t know what these scrolls are used for, then let me tell you in brief.\"","\"These teaching scrolls are special magical tools that allow a person to permanently learn a spell by directly experiencing its structure and mana flow. When a user injects mana into the scroll, the magic circle inscribed upon it activates and manifests in the air, displaying the complete spell formation.\"","\"Through this projection, the user can observe the precise mana flow pattern and is guided to replicate it within their own body.\" She paused for a while, then continued.","\"As they follow the structure, their mana is directed along the correct pathways, allowing the spell pattern to be imprinted into their mana core\"","\"However, this process requires the user to possess sufficient mana, the appropriate elemental affinity, and a good level of mana control; without these, the spell will fail to form correctly. Once the learning process is complete, the scroll loses its power and turns to ash, having fulfilled its purpose.\"","Noah did know about this. Scrolls could help a person learn magic spells faster.","But that didn’t mean one couldn’t learn spells without them. But it took a lot of time. Depending on a person’s talent, they could either learn early or late.","If a person took two to three weeks to learn a basic spell through books with magic circle drawings and its theory, then it would take less than a week for him to learn this spell with those scrolls.","’I will learn it this evening.’","He opened the scroll and checked the magic circle with excitement, only to look at the spell with a deadpan expression.","Inside, there was a blue-colored magic circle drawn. Its structure was not hard. Simple and easy.","At the upper side, its information was written in small letters.","Snow Mist: Creates a small mist of cold air and snow to block vision. Useful for escape or stealth.","Noah kept looking at it.","’Well, fair enough. It’s actually a basic spell. No wonder. Still, it could be useful to run. I don’t think I could do something like this with my ability.’","He put the scroll inside his storage ring, listening to Morgana’s lecture lazily.","---","Today there were fewer lectures, so the classes were finished early. It was still afternoon, around 3 PM.","The academy campus was wide. They had many shops there, so students wouldn’t need to go outside the academy.","Cafés, snack shops, and even potion shops were present.","There were also a few clothing shops.","They could either use money or Nova Points to purchase anything.","Currently, on a small street inside the campus, at one table inside a café, a handsome young man sat near the glass wall. His soft snow-white hair was combed neatly. His crystal blue eyes were calm as he enjoyed his coffee. In his hand, he held the cup, which he brought to his lips.","The hot bitter liquid traveled down his throat as he took a sip from his cup.","\"Hah... such a nice day,\" Noah muttered.","He was sitting beside the glass wall, watching outside.","Students walked through the roads. Green trees stood on both sides of the road. The leaves rustled softly in the wind, making a whistling sound. Sunlight poured onto the road through the branches.","Other shops were present on the opposite side.","\"It’s so peaceful.\" Noah leaned back against the chair.","Since coming to this world, Noah had spent most of his time training.","Yes, he didn’t try to play any games, watch any series, or read webnovels.","They did exist even in this world.","Still, he never bothered with them.","’That aside... when will the first event, act, or arc—whatever it might be—occur? Everything is going too smoothly.’","He put the cup on the table while still looking outside.","’Damn! I forgot to ask Morgana about joining the Adventurer Guild.’","Noah wanted to ask her about this so he could raid dungeons during weekends, which would help him a lot with his training.","He took the last sip of the coffee and decided to go to her office to ask her.","Noah walked toward the counter, took out his mobile, and paid the bill with Nova Points.","He ran a hand through his soft snow-white hair, adjusting it better. He walked toward the entrance door as it slid open on its own.","On the opposite side of the café were other huge buildings. They were other shops. Noah saw them. \"Should I purchase some snacks?\"","Looking ahead, he decided to buy a few. He tried to cross the road, but just then,","BOOOOOMMMMM!","The front side of those buildings exploded loudly.","The impact of the explosion was so strong that the wave from it pushed Noah with high force.","Noah was thrown back by that intense force. His body crashed against the glass wall, shattering it, and he flew inside the café.","Thud!","His body hit against the wall.","\"Arrggggh!\" A painful scream came out of his mouth when he crashed against the wall. Pain shot through all over his body.","As he fell down on the floor."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: First Incident (1)","paragraphs":["\"Cough!.. what the hell?\" Noah coughed as he pushed himself to his feet.","His back was in pain.","His vision was still blurred. Blinking his eyes to see clearly, he could hear distant cries of students asking for help.","\"What... what just happened?\" He couldn’t make any sense of the situation.","He leaned back against the wall.","Slowly, his vision became clear. He turned around to see that, just some distance away from him, a staff member who was working in the café was also sitting on the ground, groaning in pain.","He walked toward him with slow steps.","BOOM!","Another sound of something huge breaking came from outside.","He knelt near the man. \"Hey... are you okay?\"","The man, who was shaking his head to come to his senses, nodded at Noah’s words.","\"Yes... I am okay... but we need to get out... this place is under attack..\"","\"Kyaah!\"","\"Arrrghhhh!\"","\"Grarrghh!\"","\"Run! Run!\"","Screams of students and workers came from outside the café. While a few students lay inside the café, hurt.","\"Instructors might come here soon... so stay here...\" Saying that, Noah got up.","Most of the workers in the academy were low-ranking people with little to no experience in fighting.","’So the first scenario of the game started,’ Noah thought as his eyes turned sharp.","Noah could tell that if those intruders, whoever they were, attacked openly,","\"That means they came prepared.\"","’Instructors might not be able to come here. The place might be covered with some kind of barrier to stop anyone from entering this place. And unless the main protagonist kills the enemy, it won’t open. That’s what happens in every novel or game.’","Noah constructed the scenario in short.","He walked towards the entrance. The glass wall was shattered. He wanted to see what actually happened.","The building opposite was destroyed. Its front was shattered and fire had caught inside. Smoke was rising from it.","Students were running for their lives while screaming.","’What the hell? Why are they running away rather than fighting? Because they are extras?’ Noah thought with frowned.","But then he understood the reason of their running.","SCREEEEECHHH!","A high-pitched scream of something unknown came from the front. Something emerged from the burning building.","It was huge and tall. Noah’s eyes widened in horror. \"Monster...\"","It was a monster.","It was lizard-like in appearance. Its skin was thick and dark maroon in color. It was more than a few meters long. It had yellow-colored vertical slit reptilian eyes.","But what shocked him wasn’t the monster. It was what the monster was holding in its mouth.","A young woman’s body hung between its jaws. She was wearing the first-year academy uniform, now soaked in blood. The monster’s massive fangs had sunk deep into her stomach, piercing through her body like spears. Her body twitched slightly, still alive.","She was still breathing.","Tears streamed down her face, mixing with blood as her eyes trembled with unbearable pain and pure terror. Her hands weakly pushed against the monster’s face, trying to escape, but her strength was fading fast. The beast gave her no chance. Its jaws clenched harder.","A sickening cracking sound echoed as the fangs dug deeper into her body. Blood burst out from her stomach like a fountain, splashing onto the road, onto the monster, onto the ground beneath them.","\"ARRRGGHHHHHHHH!!\"","Her scream tore through the air. A raw, painful, desperate scream that sounded more like something breaking than a human voice.","Then, with one final bite, her body split into two halves. The upper half fell from the monster’s mouth and hit the ground with a wet thud, while the lower half remained hanging from its jaws for a moment before dropping into a pool of blood.","Noah was on the other side of the road where the monster was present. The scene made Noah’s breathing rough. His heart started to beat faster in fear against his chest.","Thump","Thump","Thump","He gulped down his saliva.","Then the monster’s vertical slit eyes met his blue eyes.","\"Shit!\" Noah cursed as he ran to the right side, running through the road.","Then suddenly that salamander-like monster dashed towards Noah.","SCREEEECHHH!!!","It screamed loudly while following him.","\"Tch!\" Noah clicked his tongue as mana wrapped around his feet to increase his speed.","But the beast was not slow either.","Its mouth opened wide, but this time it didn’t try to scream. Instead, something hot came out of its mouth. A beam of fire, like a flamethrower, shot towards Noah.","Noah gritted his teeth and threw his body to the left side.","BOOM!","The fire hit against the tree that was standing on the side of the street.","Noah rolled down and then got up.","A spear appeared in his right hand from the storage ring. The monster was much closer now. He couldn’t run away.","\"Fuck... I can’t run away.\"","He was afraid. He was really afraid after watching the sight of that woman dying by the monster.","But he couldn’t run anymore. The monster had covered the distance between them. If he tried to run away, he would be caught and killed, just like that woman.","His grip tightened on the spear.","In that case, if he needed to survive, then he had to fight. If he could not kill this monster, then he needed to buy time until someone came to help him.","The huge monster dashed toward Noah with its open mouth, rows of sharp teeth visible as saliva and blood dripped from its jaws.","Students were still running everywhere.","\"Run! Run away!!\"","\"Monster! There’s a monster!!\"","\"Help! Somebody help!\"","\"Ahhhh! It’s coming this way!! Its too stronger.\"","Some students fell while running, others dragged their injured friends. Smoke was rising from the burning building, and the smell of fire and blood filled the air.","The monster’s jaws opened wide enough to swallow his head whole.","Noah’s eyes sharpened. His heart started to calm slightly. He couldn’t survive if he acted like a coward.","He had fought a huge bear monster before, gone through a life and death battle, and somehow survived.","So he would do it again. To survive, he would fight a monster stronger than him.","\"Let’s do it!\"","He stomped his foot on the ground and activated his ability. Two ice spikes suddenly shot up from the road just below where the monster stepped.","CRACK!","The sharp tips of the spikes lifted the monster off the ground, piercing into its thick maroon skin. The spikes dug slightly into its flesh, and dark blood dripped down the ice.","SCREEEECHHHHH!!!","The monster let out a loud, ear-piercing scream and thrashed its body violently. However, the attack did not do much damage to its body."]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: First Incident (2)","paragraphs":["SCREEEECHHHHH!!!","The monster let out a loud, ear-piercing scream and thrashed its body violently. However, the attack did not do much damage.","The monster’s skin was too thick. The spikes only pierced a little before cracking under its weight.","CRACK! CRACK!","The ice spikes shattered, and the monster fell back down onto the road with a heavy thud.","BOOM!","The ground shook slightly when it landed.","Noah clicked his tongue. \"Tch... too tough.\"","The monster immediately raised its head and looked at Noah again with its yellow vertical slit eyes filled with rage.","SCREEEEECHHH!!!","It screamed again and rushed toward him even faster this time. Students nearby screamed in terror.","Noah took a quick glance in that direction. His eyes widened in terror.","Some distance away from him, another monster of the same kind was there. Two students were trying to fight it.","’Fuck! There are more monsters.’ The monster ran toward Noah.","\"Whatever...\" Noah muttered, looking straight at his monster.","He needed to focus on the monster in front of him. He tightened his grip on the spear in his hand and circulated mana through his body. Mana flowed from his core into his arms and legs, strengthening his muscles.","His heartbeat was still fast.","Thump","Thump","Thump","But his eyes slowly became calm.","\"Fine...,\" he said under his breath, lowering his stance and pointing the spear toward the monster.","Noah kicked off the ground and dashed towards the monster. The monster also charged toward him, its heavy body shaking the road with each step.","SCREEEEECHHH!!!","It opened its mouth and tried to bite him directly. Noah slid to the side at the last moment and thrust his spear forward.","Clang!","The spear tip hit the monster’s thick skin and slid sideways, failing to pierce deeply.","\"So tough!\" Noah gritted his teeth.","The monster swung its massive tail. Noah quickly jumped back.","BOOM!","The tail smashed into the road, cracking the stone surface and sending dust and small rocks flying everywhere. Noah immediately stretched his left hand toward the ground.","Using his innate ability, Ice Creation, he started to form a plain thin ice surface under the monster. Cold mana flowed out from his body into the ground. In an instant, a patch of ice formed under the monster’s feet.","The monster stepped on the ice and its balance shook slightly as its claws slipped on it.","’Now!’ His eyes narrowed.","Noah raised his hand. Mana moved from his core toward his extended hand. A blue-colored magic circle formed in the air. Multiple ice shards formed in front of the circle.","[Ice Shard]","The shards shot forward like arrows and struck the monster’s body.","Tak! Tak! Tak! Tak!","Some shards broke on impact, while a few pierced slightly into softer areas between the scales.","\"As expected... spells cost less mana compared to my ability.\" Noah watched as he caused some damage to the monster.","Dark blood dripped from the small wounds.","SCREEEECHHHHH!!!","The monster roared in anger and opened its mouth again. Fire gathered inside its throat.","\"Shit!\"","A stream of fire shot toward Noah. He slammed his spear into the ground and jumped to the side while creating a wall of ice in front of him.","The flames hit the ice wall.","HISSSSSSS!","Steam exploded into the air as the ice melted rapidly, but it blocked enough of the fire for Noah to escape.","He rolled on the ground and stood up again, breathing heavily.","’Ice Shard doesn’t do enough damage... Ice spikes also not enough... I can’t penetrate its scales.’","The monster charged again, faster this time.","Noah waited for the monster to come closer. At the last moment, Noah slammed his feet onto the ground again.","This time, instead of just a small place, he froze a large area of the road completely. The monster ran onto the frozen surface at full speed. Its claws lost grip once again, just like before.","Its huge body slipped forward uncontrollably.","\"Got you.\"","Noah stepped to the side and used all the strength in his body, mana flowing into his arms. He thrust his spear with full force toward the monster’s eye.","The spear shot forward like a bullet toward the monster’s yellow eye as its body slid across the ice toward him.","Crushed!","Splattered.","The tip of his spear blade tore inside the monster’s yellow eye. Blood gushed out from it like a fountain. Instantly, he pulled out the spear.","SCREEEECHH!","As the monster stopped sliding, it screamed loudly, this time in pain.","’Fuck! It’s also hard for me to move on ice.’","The monster stopped in one place and slammed its thick leg on the ice surface with great force.","BOOM!","The ice surface around it shattered. Its one yellow eye glared at Noah.","ROOAAARRRRR!","It dashed towards Noah again.","Noah did not back down. As the monster rushed toward him again, he extended his arm forward.","[Frost Bind]","Cold mana surged from his core into the ground beneath the monster. Ice suddenly formed around the monster’s two front legs, rapidly coating them and freezing them to the ground.","CRACK! CRACK!","Thick layers of ice wrapped around its legs, stopping its movement for a moment.","SCREEEECHHH!!!","The monster struggled, trying to move forward, but its legs were frozen in place.","\"Now!\"","Noah dashed forward, gripping his spear tightly. Mana flowed into his arms as he thrust the spear toward the monster’s neck, just under its head where the scales were slightly thinner.","Thrust!","The spear tip pierced into its flesh slightly, but not too deep. Dark blood flowed out from the wound.","SCREEEECHHHH!!!","The monster roared in pain and rage. Its long tail suddenly swung from the side at terrifying speed. Before Noah could fully pull back his spear, the tail slammed into his body.","BOOM!","\"Ughhh!\"","Noah’s body was thrown sideways, sliding across the road for several meters before he crashed and rolled on the ground.","He felt like some bones in his ribs were broken. A sharp pain shot from the side where he was hit.","He coughed, yet forced himself to stand up quickly with clenched teeth, holding his spear tightly. ’I don’t have time... Frost Bind won’t hold it for long.’","Noah stretched his free hand toward the air and began to use his innate ability again.","---","[A/N: I know...this is shamless to ask...hut well my ither novels have less number if readers. So don’t forget to add my other novel \"The Smiling Death\" to you library. And give it a try by reading it. If you love fun and comedy novels. Then you will love that one]"]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: First Incident (3)","paragraphs":["Noah did not back down. As the monster rushed toward him again, he extended his arm forward.","[Frost Bind]","Cold mana surged from his core into the ground beneath the monster. Ice suddenly formed around the monster’s two front legs, rapidly coating them and freezing them to the ground.","CRACK! CRACK!","Thick layers of ice wrapped around its legs, stopping its movement for a moment.","SCREEEECHHH!!!","The monster struggled, trying to move forward, but its legs were frozen in place.","Noah dashed forward, gripping his spear tightly. Mana flowed into his arms as he thrust the spear toward the monster’s neck, just under its head where the scales were slightly thinner.","Thrust!","The spear tip pierced into its flesh slightly, but not too deep.","Dark blood flowed out from the wound.","SCREEEECHHHH!!!","The monster roared in pain and rage. Its long tail suddenly swung from the side at terrifying speed.","Before Noah could fully pull back his spear, the tail slammed into his body.","BOOM!","\"Ughhh!\"","Noah’s body was thrown sideways, sliding across the road for several meters before he crashed and rolled on the ground.","He felt like some bones of his ribs were broken. A sharp pain shot from the side where he was hit.","He coughed, yet forced himself to stand up quickly with clenched teeth, holding his spear tightly.","The monster was still struggling against the ice binding its legs.","’I don’t have time... Frost Bind won’t hold it for long.’","Noah stretched his free hand toward the air and began to use his innate ability again.","Cold air gathered in front of him. Ice particles formed in the air and started gathering together, forming the shape of a small, sharp sword floating in midair above the monster.","The monster finally broke free from the ice around its legs.","CRACK! SHATTER!","It roared and immediately charged toward Noah again, now half-blind and covered in blood. He sent the ice sword higher into the air.","SCREEEECHHH!!!","Noah watched carefully as the monster approached.","The floating ice sword now remained above the monster.","It got closer.","At the last moment, the monster swung its claw toward Noah’s head.","Noah quickly ducked down to avoid the claw as it passed just above him.","Whoosh!","At the same time, Noah moved his free hand downward.","The ice sword above the monster moved instantly.","It shot down at high speed.","Stab!","The sharp ice sword pierced straight into the monster’s remaining eye.","Crack!","The ice blade buried deep into the eye, destroying it completely.","SCREEEEEEEEEECHHHHHHHHHH!!!","The monster let out a horrifying scream, louder than before, shaking the air around them as it became completely blind, thrashing its body wildly in pain and rage.","Noah stepped backward a few meters away from it. The monster was screaming and moving violently in pain.","Noah raised his right hand above his right shoulder, spear gripped tightly in a horizontal position, its blade directed at the lizard monster.","Mana swirled around the spear, making it glow slightly in blue color. It reinforced the spear.","Noah put his left foot forward, then with all of his strength, he threw the spear at the opened mouth of the monster.","The spear dashed forward like an arrow. It moved like a blue flash. It tore through the air with a whistling sound.","Noah didn’t wait; rather, he ran behind the spear. The salamander was screaming, its jaw was opened. The spear cleanly struck inside its mouth.","GRRRCCHHKKKKK!!!","The spear stabbed deeper. Blood gushed out from its mouth.","It thrashed violently in pain, not able to see anything.","Noah, who was closer to it, raised his hand and held the shaft of the spear.","With his strengthened muscles, Noah pushed the spear deeper with his full force. \"ARRRGGGHHH!!\" he screamed loudly while pushing it.","The spear continued to dig inside.","RECCHKKKKKK!!!","The monster raised its claw to attack, but it couldn’t see. The claw clashed on the road just beside Noah, but it didn’t stop him. The sharp spear moved forward.","Splattered!","The spear tip tore through the back side of the monster’s neck.","The blood splattered from both sides.","Some blood sprayed on Noah’s white hair, drenching him with blood.","The light in its eyes dimmed as the monster died.","Noah pulled out the spear from its mouth and stepped back. The huge body fell lifelessly.","Thud!","\"Haf... haf...\" Noah gasped for air.","He was able to kill the monster. Blood slowly flowed from his forehead.","\"Damn! Killing one monster was so hard for me!\"","And there were more monsters out there. He didn’t even know how many were there, how big the area was where monsters were spread, who was behind them, or where that person was.","He used his hand to clean off the blood on his forehead with his uniform’s sleeve.","BOOM!","Just then another sound of an explosion came. It was small, not too big.","There was still battle going on. Noah looked toward the side where two students were trying to kill a monster.","Noah narrowed his eyes. ’There are mostly first-year students around this area. A few might be second year... but I hardly saw them here. Whoever planned this... he really did everything thoughtfully. But what are they after?’","There was no point in thinking. Farther away from him, another fight was going on with monsters.","Noah could see it from his place. \"Multiple fights going on... where the heck is the main cast? I need to find them to be safe.\" Noah started to run forward in the direction where another battle was ongoing with the same kind of monster.","Maybe it was because of killing a monster just now, that also alone. He felt more confident.","He aimed his spear once again and threw it with all his might.","The spear once again shot forward, this time in the direction of its leg.","Crushed!","SCREEEECHHH!","The spear tore inside the thick leg and stuck there.","The monster screamed in pain. Taking that chance, the two students near it simultaneously attacked.","The monster screamed in pain as Noah’s spear pierced deep into its leg.","SCREEEECHHHH!!!","It staggered forward, its movement becoming unstable. Dark blood flowed down its thick leg as it tried to pull the spear out but failed.","The monster then turned its head and looked in Noah’s direction, its yellow eyes filled with rage. That moment of distraction was enough.","\"Now!\""]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: First Incident (4)","paragraphs":["\"Now!\" one of the student shouted.","The two students who were fighting the monster moved at the same time.","One of them was a beastman with gray cat-like ears on his head. He wore metal gauntlets that were shining in a dark blue color, mana swirling around them.","He bent his knees and jumped high into the air. Mana gathered around his right fist.","\"Haah!\"","He swung his fist downward and punched the monster straight on its forehead.","BOOM!","The impact produced a dull explosion-like sound. The monster’s head was forced downward from the heavy punch.","At the same time, the second student moved.","He was very tall, nearly 200 cm, with a strong build. He was holding a large battle axe in both hands.","As the monster’s head was forced down by the punch, the tall student stepped forward and swung his battle axe horizontally with perfect timing.","Slash!","The sharp blade cut deep into the monster’s neck. Dark blood burst out like a fountain.","SCREEEEE!!","The monster tried to scream, but the sound was cut short. The tall student roared and pushed the axe deeper.","\"DIE!\"","With one final powerful pull, he dragged the axe across the monster’s neck.","CRRRAAACK!","The neck was almost cut in half, and the monster’s huge body shook violently before collapsing to the ground.","THUD!","The ground trembled slightly as the monster fell lifelessly.","For a few seconds, no one spoke.","The beastman landed on the ground and shook his hand slightly. The tall student pulled his axe out from the monster’s neck, breathing heavily.","Then both of them looked toward Noah, who was standing some distance away.","Noah walked towards them.","\"Nice! You two killed it,\" he said while coming closer to them. He bent and pulled out the spear from its leg.","\"Thanks for the help,\" the beastman with cat-like ears thanked Noah. The young man had green eyes. He was a few centimeters shorter in height compared to Noah. His gray hair had black streaks in the middle, while the cat-like tail looked more like a tiger’s, since it also had black stripes on the gray tail.","Beside him stood a tall muscular man. Nearly 200 centimeters tall, his skin slightly tanned, short brown hair.","\"Your aim was good. Thanks,\" the tall man said with a heavy voice, befitting his huge build. He talked at a slower speed than normal.","’Is he a Barbarian?’ Noah wondered after seeing his huge size.","Barbarians exist in this world. They do not possess a separate nation. Rather, they have tribes spread in different sides of the empire.","Some live in forests. Some live in deserted lands, while some live in snowy mountains. The man in front of Noah did look like he was from those Barbarian tribes.","\"Don’t mention it. I am Noah Eldritch,\" Noah introduced himself.","Those two looked like they were from another class.","\"I am Regnar Duskfang,\" the beastman introduced himself.","\"I am Draven Rockbane.\" Following him, the barbarian-looking man also spoke his name.","\"Well, formalities are enough. We should go and kill other monsters and try to find a way. It seems we are stuck inside a barrier-like thing. If not for that, instructors might have come to help us by now,\" Noah told them what he thought.","\"Ohhh! You are smart!\" Draven said with a surprised expression.","\"What? That’s common sense. What smart is there? Anyways, let’s go and find a way out,\" Regnar said while looking at Draven like he was some kind of idiot.","Noah ignored his comment. \"By the way, do you have a mana recovery potion?\"","He asked for the important thing. He was hurt and tired, but he could handle that much pain. But his mana was half drained. Just a few more battles and his mana would be exhausted. It’s better to have a mana recovery potion just in case.","Unfortunately, Noah possessed nothing. If he knew something like this was going to happen, he would have already prepared in advance. But no, he had no idea about these things.","\"Well, I do have some.\" Regnar pulled out two potion bottles. They were small and made up of transparent glass.","\"Take this. One is a mana recovery potion while the other is a healing potion. Also, both of them are low grade, but useful anyway.\"","Noah raised his brow, surprised at his kindness. He didn’t question and took both of them.","8","\"Thank you for this.\"","\"No problem. You first came to help us.\" Regnar shook his head, saying there was no need to thank him.","Though Noah could tell that they didn’t need his help. Both of them looked strong enough to kill the monster.","What Noah did was just save their time from dragging the battle.","\"Okay, let’s go!\" Noah declared.","Both Regnar and Draven nodded. They moved straight on the road.","Noah saw on the left side of the road there lay another dead body of a student, while inside one broken shop a few figures lay dead. The staff who worked there.","Noah shook his head and tried to focus on the fight. Pushing his thoughts about death aside.","\"Let’s help others kill those monsters first.\"","\"Got it!\" Regnar agreed.","\"Yes! Fight!!\" Draven screamed in excitement.","The trio moved towards other students.","\"Shitt! They are strong!\"","\"When will the instructors come?\"","A girl and a boy were fighting another monster.","Regnar increased his speed. He was more agile and faster than Noah and Draven.","He moved behind the monster, grabbing its thick tail with strong hands.","Just behind him was Noah running.","He used Bind spell to lock the monster’s front feet.","[Frost Bind]","Draven was slower than Noah because of his huge body, but he was physically stronger than both Noah and Regnar.","The giant man bent his knees and pushed himself up with all his might.","\"Arrrhhhhh!\"","He jumped higher than expected.","Noah was once again surprised. Draven directly landed on the monster’s back.","Thud!","Screeeechhhh!!!","The monster screamed and violently thrashed its body to throw him off.","Regnar from behind gritted his teeth to hold the tail tightly so the monster wouldn’t attack with it.","Noah took the chance and thrust his spear at the neck.The blade was covered with dense mana this time.","Splattered!","The tip dug inside as blood splattered.","From above, Draven balanced himself somehow and drew his battle axe back with full strength.","The monster screamed in pain. Noah’s spear moved more inside the side of the neck.","Slowly the monster started to slow down its movement. Then it fell on the ground with a thud.","\"Hah... that was easier...\" Noah muttered.","Draven jumped from the monster’s back beside Noah. Regnar also came beside him.","\"We could be a great team,\" Regnar said while rubbing his chin. As the killing this monster took really less time.","The duo who were fighting the monster finally calmed down.","\"Thanks for helping us,\" the young man said sincerely.","\"Yes. Thanks for saving us. The monster was stronger for the two of us,\" the brown-haired girl said with a slightly afraid voice.","\"No worries. You two just go and stay somewhere safe.\"","’Damn! I shouldn’t be feeling good after seeing that there are students weaker than me that exist.’ Noah tried to correct his thinking. Those two bowed and left the trio.","BOOM!","Just then a loud booming sound came from the backside of the huge building, nearly 40 meters away from them.","The trio looked in that direction.","\"Hey guys... watch your surroundings more keenly... if you find some suspicious person, tell me...\"","Both Draven and Regnar looked at him, then nodded.","\"Let’s go there! A fight is going on!\"","But Draven was still more focused on fighting.","Three of them started to run toward that building.","’Damien, please be there!’ Noah hoped that he could meet the protagonist soon."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Malrick Valtheron","paragraphs":["While the area where the shops were situated was under attack, just outside that place, the instructors were gathered together.","There were many teachers standing there, all looking tense and serious.","Among them was Morgana Celestine. The woman with sky-blue hair tied in a neat bun, wearing a professional outfit. Her amethyst-colored eyes were fixed on the barrier in front of her.","Beside her stood another brown-haired beauty, Lucia Sterling. She had long smooth brown hair and sharp eyes, her expression calm but worried.","Other teachers were present as well. Just beside them stood a dirt-blonde-haired man. He was around six feet tall with a good build, wearing a black suit. His eyes were sharp green in color, and his face looked strict and composed. His name was Victor Hale, another strong and respected instructor in the academy.","In front of them was a light blue-colored dome formed over the entire area where the students were trapped inside fighting monsters.","The barrier looked like a giant transparent sphere, but no one could see what was happening inside. The surface of the barrier shimmered like sky-blue-colored water, blocking vision and sound from outside.","They had already tried attacking this barrier using different types of strong magic and even academy machines designed to break magical shields. Fire spells, lightning strikes, earth spikes, and even mana cannons were used.","Even S-rank heroes were present. Yet their strongest attacks had no use on this.","Yet the barrier didn’t even crack. It didn’t shake. It didn’t react at all.","Now their last hope was the Principal, who was going to arrive soon.","Morgana crossed her arms and spoke quietly to Lucia and the other instructors.","\"This is not a normal barrier,\" Morgana said. \"This is a high-level isolation barrier. Someone planned this.\"","Lucia frowned. \"You mean... this was an attack targeting the academy?\"","Victor Hale spoke in a deep voice, \"Most likely. And whoever created this barrier is very powerful.\"","Another instructor said nervously, \"The students inside...\"","Morgana didn’t reply immediately. She kept looking at the barrier, her eyes serious.","After a few moments, space in front of them suddenly twisted.","A circular portal opened in the air.","From the portal, a man stepped out slowly.","He had white hair and a neatly trimmed beard of the same color. He was wearing a formal dark outfit, and his presence alone made the surrounding instructors straighten their backs.","His eyes were cold black in color, and a long cut scar ran down from his left eye to his cheek. He was more than six feet tall and had an imposing aura around him.","He was the Principal of Novaris Academy.","Principal Adrian Aegeus.","As soon as he stepped out of the portal, all the instructors slightly bowed their heads.","\"Principal.\"","He just gave a slight nod to everyone and didn’t say anything.","A woman with burgundy hair tied in a loose ponytail came beside the Principal.","She was a woman in her late forties. The Vice President of the academy, Ellen Astarval.","\"Sir Adrian... we tried everything. But the barrier is not opening. We don’t know exactly what’s happening inside. We tried to contact students through mobile, but again it’s not connecting.\"","Adrian silently watched the barrier and walked towards it. He put his palm on the surface.","Closing his eyes, he tried to understand what it was. How to break it. Or dispel it.","Then he frowned. After a while, his eyes snapped open.","\"This is... we cannot open it,\" he said with a grave voice.","\"What do you mean? We cannot open it... is there not a single way to do it?\" Ellen asked worriedly.","\"There is a way... the students need to kill the person who activated this barrier. Or either someone even stronger than me will be able to break it.\" Adrian spoke with heavy voice.","Everyone gasped at his words. Someone stronger than him.","Principal Adrian Aegeus was known as one of the strongest people in the world currently. Only a handful of people were at his level. But someone stronger than him... they couldn’t even think of many names.","Silence fell over the area.","Ellen sighed tiredly and rubbed her forehead.","\"Then we can only hope the students can kill the person inside... But who in the world is capable of constructing such a barrier?\"","At her question, Adrian’s eyes turned heavy and serious.","\"There is one...\" he said slowly. \"And... he might not be present here himself. His subordinates must have come here and planted this with proper planning.\"","All the instructors listened carefully without interrupting.","\"The man who is inside the barrier is likely acting as an anchor for this barrier,\" Adrian continued. \"If he dies, the barrier will break.\"","Lucia frowned. \"So as long as that person is alive, the barrier will remain?\"","\"Yes,\" Adrian replied. \"This is not just a barrier. This is a linked domain barrier. It is connected to the life and mana of the person who activated it from inside.\"","Victor Hale clenched his fists. \"So the students are basically trapped in a death arena... or something like that?\"","Adrian didn’t deny it. He kept looking at the blue dome in front of him.","Then he spoke again in a low voice. \"This barrier was created by that person... and I know just how capable this thing is.\"","Morgana slowly turned toward him.","\"Do you know that person? You are speaking as if you know the one who created this thing.\"","Adrian remained silent for a few seconds. Then he said quietly, \"I know. Who is behind this all.\"","Everyone’s attention turned fully toward him now.","His eyes became colder.","\"If I am right... then the one behind this incident is... Malrick Valtheron.\"","Many instructors showed confused expressions, not knowing who this person was, what his background might be, or why he was doing that.","Even Morgana was not aware of any person with this name who might be as strong as Adrian.","Ellen spoke slowly, \"I thought he disappeared years ago...\"","Adrian nodded slightly.","\"So did I.\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: First Incident (5)","paragraphs":["Three of them came behind the half-broken building. They finally saw it.","There was a huge fight going on.","Behind the building was an open space, basically a large lawn area. It was big, stretching all the way until it ended at the huge wall of the academy’s compound.","ROOOOAAAAARRRR!!!","A huge roar came from there.","In the middle of that open area stood a massive monster around twenty meters tall.","Its body was covered in thick black skin that looked more like armor than flesh.","The surface of its skin was rough and cracked like some burned stone, and faint red lines glowed between those cracks as if lava was flowing inside its body. Its arms were enormous, long enough to touch the ground even while standing.","Each hand had huge claws like curved blades. Its head was slightly elongated with a wide mouth full of jagged teeth, and two horn-like structures grew from the sides of its head. Its eyes glowed a deep red, full of rage and killing intent.","And fighting against that monster were familiar figures.","A blonde-haired man with tanned skin was standing in front, holding a huge greatsword almost as tall as himself. He was Leonard.","He swung his greatsword with both hands, and every time the blade hit the monster’s body, sparks and flames burst out.","His sword was covered in fire, while the ground beneath the monster kept rising in spikes and walls, showing he was using both earth and fire elements together to fight and control the battlefield.","Not far from him stood Arisha, holding a bow. She stayed at a distance, constantly moving and shooting arrows one after another. Her violet hair flowed behind her in the wind as she jumped and slid across the ground.","Each arrow she shot was surrounded by wind, making them faster and sharper. Some arrows even split into multiple wind arrows mid-air before striking the monster’s body.","In the middle area of the battlefield was Lyria. Her golden blonde hair was tied in a high ponytail, and her pink eyes were focused and serious. She was holding a golden-colored spear and fighting at close range.","Light element surrounded her spear, forming glowing trails every time she attacked. Sometimes she cast light spells that formed small glowing magic circles around the monster, which exploded into flashes of light and pushed the monster back.","Then lastly, there was Damien. The main protagonist of the game.","He was holding his sword with both hands, standing directly in front of the monster along with Leonard.","His hazel eyes were sharp and focused completely on the monster. His sword was glowing with golden light, showing he was using the light element wrapped around his blade.","Unlike the others, Damien focused more on pure sword fighting. His movements were fast, precise, and clean. Every swing of his sword left a trail of golden light and cut deep into the monster’s thick skin.","Among all of them, Damien was clearly the strongest.","He moved the fastest, attacked the most, and every time the monster tried to attack, he was the one who blocked or redirected it.","The four of them were fighting the giant monster together, perfectly coordinating their attacks, but even then, the monster still stood tall, roaring and swinging its massive arms, shaking the ground with every step.","BOOM!","GROOWWLLLL!","The monster roared in pain as Damien landed a sharp cut on its chest.","Leonard moved near its leg and slashed it.","While Lyria’s spear, covered with light, thrust inside another leg.","The tip was hot because of the light element, giving the monster more pain.","Meanwhile, Arisha had put her bow back in her storage ring and had pulled out a wooden wand. It was waist-length in size, with a blue crystal attached at the top.","It started to shine brightly as a huge magic circle appeared in front of her.","A huge sphere of water started to form in front of her.","The water circulated at intense speed while maintaining a spherical form.","It slowly compressed into a sphere big enough to be twice the size of a football.","It shot forward in the direction of the monster’s face.","BOOM!","It perfectly hit the monster’s face and exploded with high pressure.","GROOOOOWLL!!!","The monster’s mouth opened wide as hot lava shot out in all directions.","\"Get away!\" Damien yelled at the top of his lungs.","He lunged back, away from the place where the hot lava had just fallen.","Lyria and Leonard as well moved away from it.","Arisha, who was supporting from behind, conjured a water spear spell and shot them at the lava, trying to cool it.","While away from them,","Noah, Regnar, and Draven watched the battle.","\"Let’s go! Fight! And kill that monster!\" Draven declared with determination.","Just when he was going to step into the battle with his huge axe,","Noah stopped him.","\"Wait, don’t go!\"","Draven stopped. He turned to look at Noah with confusion.","Regnar, who was also preparing to enter the battle, looked at him with a frown.","\"Why not?\" Draven asked.","\"Yeah Noah... why shouldn’t we go and help them?\" Regnar also asked him the reason to stop them.","Noah looked at the ongoing battle and said, \"Listen... those four don’t need our help. They are strong enough to handle it and kill it without getting much injured.\"","Regnar frowned further. \"And how do you know that? How could you say they are enough to kill that giant?\"","Noah replied immediately, \"Because they are my classmates. I know just how strong they are... also Damien... the man with black hair and hazel eyes is the rank one student of the first year. He’s fighting there without any problem. I think he is still holding back. You could just guess by watching them. They don’t seem to have any problem while fighting.\"","’Fuck! That monster is so strong, yet those four are fighting without taking a single damage on themselves. No wonder they are main characters,’ Noah thought bitterly.","\"Okay... I guess you are right.\" Regnar nodded in understanding.","He could see that those four were clearly stronger than Regnar himself.","\"Then what should we do?\" Draven asked with a confused face.","Noah remained silent for a while.","’We need to find the guy who is behind all this...’ Noah thought gravely. As the fight between Damien and his friends against the monster continued some distance away from the trio."]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: First Incident (6)","paragraphs":["Noah looked around, trying to observe his surroundings carefully.","There were a few small buildings here. Some were broken, while a few were still in decent condition.","’That guy... he must be here. Hiding somewhere and watching. If my guess is right... he will show himself when the main characters kill that monster, thinking they are safe now...’ Noah thought.","He then turned toward Regnar and Draven.","\"Listen. We will do a simple thing... go around these buildings, shops, and corners... and try to find any suspicious person. He might be wearing an academy staff uniform or even student clothes... but if you find someone doubtful... who looks relaxed... then quietly get away from him and come back to this place again.\"","Mobiles were not working. Noah had already tried earlier, so they couldn’t contact each other from far away.","\"We will meet each other in the same place in 15 minutes. If you come early after seeing someone suspicious... if the battle there is ended by then... just tell it to Damien,\" Noah said.","Both Draven and Regnar looked at each other, then nodded.","The three of them split up.","Noah decided to look at the same side of the road where they were currently. Draven went to the opposite side, while Regnar went back in the direction from where the three of them had come earlier.","While walking, Noah thought,","Hope I won’t meet that guy... let one of those two meet him.","Noah then entered the building beside him.","It was a burger shop.","Inside, most things were scattered everywhere. Tables had fallen on the ground along with chairs. The counter was messy, and trays, cups, and bottles were lying all over the floor. It looked like the people inside had run away in a hurry when the attack started.","Noah walked slowly inside, looking around carefully.","His footsteps made light sounds on the broken glass and plastic lying on the floor.","He checked behind the counter first. Then he checked the kitchen area. The stove was still slightly warm, and half-cooked patties were still on the pan. Someone had definitely left in a hurry.","He opened the storage room door slowly.","Creeeak...","The door made a low sound as it opened.","Noah immediately held his spear tighter and looked inside.","There were boxes of buns, sauces, vegetables, and meat stored inside. Everything looked normal. No one was hiding there.","He closed the door again and sighed slightly.","\"Nothing here...\"","He got out and went to another shop beside it.","He then walked toward the stairs at the back of the shop that led to the upper floor.","He moved slowly and quietly, trying not to make too much noise.","Step by step, he climbed the stairs.","When he reached the top, he saw a small office room and a staff resting area with a few lockers and a sofa.","One locker door was open, and clothes were half hanging out of it.","Again, it looked like someone had left in a hurry.","Noah walked inside and checked if there was anything, even some suspicious-looking thing.","But he found nothing.","After checking everything, he stood near the window and looked outside.","From here, he could see the open lawn area in the distance where Damien and the others were still fighting the giant monster. Flashes of light, fire, wind, and explosions were visible from here.","BOOM!","The monster was too injured. The fight would end soon.","’They are still fighting... That monster is really tough,’ Noah thought.","Most students and others had run in the direction of the main academy building.","’But... they might not be able to get out. They must have remained hidden in different corners.’","Noah looked above. The sky was clear.","No help had come till now.","Then his expression slowly became serious again.","’If I were the mastermind behind this... I would hide somewhere high... where I could see the whole battlefield... and wait for the right moment...’","Noah slowly turned his head and looked at the buildings around.","Some buildings had second floors. Some had rooftops. Some had broken walls and empty windows.","’Yeah... if I were him... I would watch everything from above,’Noah thought.","He then left the room and quickly went down the stairs again.","\"I should check the rooftops...\" he muttered quietly to himself.","Noah stepped out of the shop and looked at the surrounding buildings again, his eyes slowly scanning the windows, rooftops, and shadows between the buildings.","He checked another one. But found nothing.","Somewhere nearby, the real enemy might be watching everything and waiting for the right moment to appear.","After walking in a straight direction, he saw a tall building. It was a cake shop. Having first floor and terrace on it. Mostly the upper floor was for the resting area of the staff. Above it was a terrace area. Some part of it was broken.","The building size was larger compared to others.","’Let’s check that one.’","The moment Noah stepped inside, the scent of blood hit him.","He frowned.","Walking forward, he saw two or three academy students dead inside the shop.","\"...Many students died...\" He walked forward, not willing to look at them. Their faces were disfigured by the claws of the monster, bloodied and not recognizable.","The tables and chairs were thrown on the floor. Some were broken.","Near the counter, another two dead bodies were lying. Their necks were cut with some sharp blade. Fresh blood was leaking out from them.","Noah stopped at that. He got closer to those figures.","Unlike those three dead bodies, these didn’t look like someone who were killed by a monster...","\"They... were killed by a person.\"","Noah gripped his spear tightly. His expression turned serious. He started to check the ground floor and inside rooms.","But there was no one present. He looked up... towards the upper floor.","\"Maybe up...\"","Noah walked toward the stairs and started to climb them. On the first floor, there were two room. Just an office room and a resting place.","Nothing suspicious. No one was here. Everything was calm.","One corner of the resting room was destroyed. The walls were broken.","After that, he went to another set of stairs that led up to the terrace area.","Noah slowly, step by step, walked.","His heartbeat faster.","Thump","Thump","Thump","As much as he was curious to see, he was also afraid to meet the person who did this.","He reached the door of the terrace which was slightly open.","Noah gulped down his saliva and peeked through the space.","’Fuck!’","He cursed inside.","His luck was really bad. There were two more people who were searching for enemy.","But why it has to be him?","’Was it because I am a transmigrator? Fuck!’","There was actually a figure standing at the edge of the terrace, looking at the ongoing battle between Damien’s team and monster."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: First Incident (7)","paragraphs":["Noah remained standing there without making any noise.","He could see the man’s back. He was wearing a blue-colored T-shirt and black pants, which were the uniform for academy workers.","His hair was black. Noah observed the man for a while.","’I should get out from here slowly.’","But just when he was about to turn around to leave, the man spoke.","\"Where are you going? You came to find me... now leaving without greeting me?\"","Noah’s whole body stiffened. He stood there like a frozen statue.","’Damnit!’","He slowly forced himself to turn around.","He could simply run away, but he decided not to. The man could just chase him.","Or maybe... if he ran away, then he didn’t know how much time it would take for this man to show himself again. He might hide somewhere else.","’Calm down, Noah.’","He held the door and slowly opened it. The man came into view. He was still looking at the battle that was going on.","Noah stepped onto the terrace.","The man was standing at the edge, leaning against the parapet wall.","\"Isn’t today’s sight beautiful? What do you think?\" the man asked, still looking forward. He was talking as if he was Noah’s old friend.","He was too casual.","Noah clenched the fist of his free hand tightly, while his grip on the spear tightened.","What was he talking about? Beautiful sight? He killed so many innocent students and workers. They lay lifeless out there, dying for no reason.","Even Noah’s life was in danger as well.","And now this man was asking if today’s sight was beautiful or not.","Yet Noah didn’t burst out. Rather, a smile crept onto his face.","\"Of course. Today’s sight was such a beautiful one. The helpless cries of young students. Their painful screams while trying to run for their lives. Their fresh blood that splattered on the roads while fighting monsters. Their dead bodies lying on the road like some showpieces. Hehe~\" Noah giggled.","\"It was just amazing. The scent of blood flowing in the air was even more euphoric,\" Noah continued to talk in a dramatic way.","Finally, the man turned around.","Noah could see his face. He looked in his late twenties. Black hair and green-colored eyes.","On his chest, his name was written.","’Petrick’","A delightful smile bloomed on Petrick’s face.","\"Oh finally! I met someone who appreciates such a beautiful sight! You cannot believe just how happy I am after hearing you praise my sweet work. Haha!\" Petrick laughed happily, calling his disgusting deeds beautiful work.","Noah didn’t show anything on his face. He kept a gentle smile.","\"I know, I know! That was something amazing.\"","Petrick raised his hand and pointed at Noah with his index finger, then shook it while laughing. \"Haha! Boy, I like you. Thank you for complimenting me.\"","\"No! No need to thank me... can I know your name?\"","Petrick looked at Noah with confusion.","\"What? My name? Well, it’s Petrick. It’s written on my shirt.\"","\"Oh, come on. I know that’s not your real name. You just made that name to enter the Academy. There’s no way you would use your real name. It’s easy to guess.\"","Noah paused for a moment and started to think. He turned to right and walked. After few steps he stopped. then turned to face Petrick again and continued.","\"Or... you are controlling the body of a worker named Petrick from far away.\" he asked with knowing smile.","This time, Petrick’s smile nearly broke.","But he forced himself to smile again.","\"Interesting speculation... but why would you even think something like that? That I might be controlling a body from outside. It sounds ridiculous.\"","Noah didn’t reply for a moment, a smile still playing on his face.","Mana slowly gathered around his right hand, the one holding the spear.","\"Nothing is ridiculous in a magical world. There were many things that pointed out that you are using someone else’s body to control and use it.\"","\"Interesting... you are no fool, I guess.\" The man took one step forward.","\"Can you tell me why you think so? How did you come to that conclusion?\"","\"Pretty easy. Looking at the physique of this body, I can tell you are... or should I say, Petrick is not a weapon user. The body is thin, no muscles that indicate hard physical work. No calluses either. It shows no experience in weapon wielding. There’s no way the enemy who came here to kill people would be weak.\"","\"I could be a mage... someone who focuses more on magic.\"","\"True... you might be. But then again, the dead bodies at the counter had sharp cuts on them. Cuts that are only possible with a blade and by no means do they look like they were done by a novice or a mage who never trained with weapons.\"","Noah then continued,","\"And lastly... which idiot would enter the Academy directly? There are so many monstrous instructors here. One mistake and you cannot escape from this place. I don’t know which organization you came from, but they wouldn’t hand this mission to someone weak or inexperienced. So they gave it to you... someone strong, who can play safe from afar.\"","Petrick continued to smile.","\"You are really interesting.\"","\"That aside... so... can you tell me your name?\" Noah asked again.","Mana moved toward his feet as the floor beneath him started to freeze.","Petrick didn’t reply.","He vanished from his position.","Noah instinctively moved. His spear came in front of him as something clashed against his spear.","Clang!","Sparks flew.","\"Arrrgh!\"","Petrick had attacked Noah with his dagger, and the impact was so strong that he was thrown back.","His body shot toward the parapet wall.","Crashed.","THUD!","\"Arrrrrghh!\"","His back hit against the waist length parapet wall. The pointed edge struck his back, giving him more pain.","\"Dammit!\"","He had used his innate ability to freeze the floor around where he was standing just moments ago.","\"What?\" Petrick was surprised as he nearly lost his balance. He remained standing where Noah was just a few seconds ago after attacking him. Now trying to keep his balance.","\"Haha~ let’s see if you can kill me or not,\" Noah said with a smirk.","Noah, who was leaning against the waist-length wall while looking at Petrick, threw his body backward as he fell from the building while laughing."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: First Incident (8)","paragraphs":["Noah fell from the terrace.","His body twisted mid-air. He gathered mana around his feet.","Just below him was a huge panel on which the name of the shop was written.","He landed on the edge of the panel, then jumped from it and landed on the street. His landing sent a sharp pain through his back because of the hit he had taken just a few seconds ago.","Noah didn’t even look up and started to run with all his strength.","Mana enforced his movements, making him faster. He ran faster than ever. It was a run for his life. The man would come behind him at any time.","He held the spear tightly, being ready for an attack at any time.","Mana started to move towards the weapon, covering it with a blue glow.","Petrick had also followed him. He jumped from the terrace, running behind Noah.","Just then, with unbelievable speed, Petrick came behind him. He was holding daggers in both hands. He swung the dagger in his right hand. A sharp black slash shot out from the dagger, going towards Noah.","Noah, who had already sensed Petrick coming from behind, spun on his feet and swung his spear with all his might.","The dark slash crashed heavily against his spear.","But Noah didn’t try to put much force into blocking it. Rather, he deliberately used just enough strength to not get injured. The slash was strong, and its impact sent Noah flying back a few meters. Noah rolled on the ground and got up instantly.","The man was already upon him.","Spear met dagger.","Clang!","Clang!","Clang!","Noah fought with everything he had, while Petrick, with a smile on his face, casually parried his attacks as if he was just playing with him.","Petrick moved smoothly, his daggers flashing again and again, aiming for Noah’s neck, ribs, and thighs. Every attack was precise and deadly.","Noah blocked one dagger with his spear shaft and quickly stepped back to avoid the second dagger that sliced through the air where his stomach had been just a moment ago.","Each of Petrick’s strikes sent tremors through his body.","’Fuck! Even though he is using someone else’s body... someone who is so weak... why are his attacks so strong?’ Noah gritted his teeth as his body continued to ache in pain.","Just then, ice suddenly formed around Petrick’s one leg, freezing it to the ground for a few seconds.","Noah didn’t waste that opportunity.","He held his spear only in his right hand and thrust it straight toward Petrick’s heart.","Petrick immediately crossed one dagger in front of his chest and blocked the spear.","But that was not Noah’s real attack.","Noah’s free hand moved at blinding speed as a dagger made of ice appeared in his left hand. He slashed it toward Petrick’s face.","Petrick tilted his head slightly and blocked the ice dagger just in time with his other dagger.","Clang!","Their weapons locked for a brief moment. Petrick looked at Noah from a very close distance and smirked.","\"You are quite amazing at using ice,\" Petrick said calmly. \"How did you create ice without using any spell?\" he asked curiously. \"You are not too strong... but still you do know how to fight... to survive.\"","Noah didn’t reply. Instead, he suddenly kicked Petrick in the stomach and jumped back to create distance.","The ice dagger in his hand shattered into small particles.","Petrick slid back a step but didn’t lose his balance.","Noah immediately slammed the butt of his spear on the ground.","Mana shot from his legs towards the place where Petrick was standing.","Several sharp ice spikes shot out from the ground toward Petrick.","But Petrick jumped sideways and spun in the air, easily avoiding them. The spikes pierced the ground where he had been standing just a moment ago.","The moment he landed, he dashed toward Noah again at terrifying speed.","Noah barely managed to raise his spear in time.","Clang!","Petrick’s dagger collided with the spear, and he immediately followed with another slash from the other hand.","Noah twisted his body and avoided it by a hair’s breadth, but the dagger still cut his sleeve and left a deep cut on his arm.","Blood came out.","\"Arrrghh!\" he screamed in pain.","Noah jumped back again, breathing heavily now, blood streaming down from the cut.","Petrick, on the other hand, looked completely relaxed. He slowly walked toward Noah, spinning one dagger in his hand.","\"You are running, blocking, and creating openings... You are not fighting to kill me,\" Petrick said with a grin. \"You are fighting to survive... but you told me... try killing you... if I can. So I will do it.\"","Noah tightened his grip on his spear but said nothing.","’Just like I thought... the villains from novels and games really talk unnecessarily a lot.’","His mana slowly circulated through his body again, gathering in his legs and arms.","’He is too fast... too experienced... I can’t beat him in direct combat... but... I am getting closer.’","A smile appeared on his face.","What Noah wanted to do was bring Petrick toward the place where he and the others were supposed to meet.","Soon they would be there and help him.","’Also, hope Damien and others had killed the monster by now....then it will be more easy to kill him.’","Just then Petrick suddenly disappeared from his spot.","Noah’s eyes widened.","’Where?’","He instantly raised his spear. As Petrick appeared on front of him.","Clang!!!","The impact was so strong that Noah’s hands shook. Immediately after the clash, Petrick kicked Noah in the stomach with intense force.","Bang!","Noah’s body arched like a bow, and he was thrown back again, sliding across the street and leaving a long mark on the ground.","He coughed and forced himself to stand up again, holding his spear tightly.","Blood came out from his mouth as he could taste the iron in it.","Petrick slowly walked toward him again, smiling.","\"Run more,\" Petrick said. \"I like hunting more than killing.\"","Noah smiled. Despite the situation he was in, he was starting to enjoy it.","\"Let’s fight!\"","’Just a little more... I need to hold for a while. ’","With a smile, he dashed forward once again."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: First Incident (9)","paragraphs":["Noah dashed forward again. Petrick kicked off the ground and shot toward Noah.","CLANG!","Sparks flew as their weapons met.","Petrick moved even faster now.","Slash","Slash","Slash","Noah tried to avoid his attacks, he avoided few of them but not all.","Cuts appeared on his forearms, his shoulder, and his cheeks. Fresh blood flew into the surrounding. That belonged to Noah.","Not even minutes had passed since they started clashing, yet Petrick had already given Noah so many wounds.","But Noah never stopped smiling. Their weapons collided against each other once more. They pushed each other. As a distance formed between them.","Noah used that moment and started to use his ability.","Just then, Petrick raised his hand. A huge magic circle made of dark lines started to form in front of him.","Noah didn’t give him the chance. He focused and forced himself to create two ice swords as fast as possible.","\"Arrrghhh!\" he suddenly yelled with force.","Petrick narrowed his eyes.","On both sides of Petrick, two ice swords formed within seconds.","Noah’s brain throbbed while creating them. Those swords, they floated on Petrick’s right and left sides.","The tips of the blades pointed at him. They shot toward Petrick at the same time.","\"Ohh?\" Petrick showed surprise. But it was not enough to defeat him. He bent his knees and jumped high into the air, trying to move backward.","The spell he was attempting to conjure shattered into nothingness as he jumped back.","While the swords struck empty space. But Noah didn’t let them collide against each other.","His spear fell from his grip as he grabbed both cold hilt of those swords in his hands. Then, with a sharp gaze, he dashed forward.","Noah’s left hand moved up to his right shoulder, then came down in a diagonal slash. He aimed at Petrick’s neck, who had just landed on the street.","Clang!","The ice sword met a dagger as Petrick blocked the attack.","In that instant, Noah raised his right sword and slashed against the blade of the sword in left hand, giving it more force to push forward.","\"Arrghhh!\" he screamed in rage.","Petrick’s knees bent for the first time. His dagger was pushed down slightly as the blade of the ice sword came very close to his neck.","Very close. But just then, Petrick kicked Noah on the knee very hard.","\"Gahh!\"","Noah nearly lost his balance.","Petrick took that chance to slide away from Noah’s sword. He moved back as the ice sword came down.","Petrick instantly slashed at Noah’s chest. A dark arc of darkness shot toward Noah.","Noah tried to block it by raising his sword, but he was slightly late, and a slash formed across his chest.","Blood gushed out from it.","\"Garrhhh!\"","Petrick came in front of him.","This time his dagger, which was covered with darkness, came to cut his neck.","Noah’s vision nearly blurred. Somehow, he forced his body to move. He ducked down in time.","But what came toward him was Petrick’s knee. It hit against his jaw intensely.","\"Arrgghhh!!\"","Pain shot through his mouth. His head snapped back because of it. Blood flew from his open mouth. His lips were also tore by the strike.","’Not... yet... I cannot...’ He encouraged himself.","Petrick smirked and this time thrust his dagger at Noah’s heart.","’I won’t.’ Noah’s blue eyes filled with resolved.","Despite the pain, Noah moved his body. He bent on his right knee. He got down as the dagger tore into his shoulder rather than his chest.","Blood gushed out from it.","\"AAGGHHH!!\" He screamed out of his lungs. The pain was impossible to bear. The sharp blade of the dagger dug inside his flesh.","Near the shoulder area, just below beside the collarbone. Noah’s right knee touched the ground.","This time Petrick didn’t attack. Rather, he looked at Noah with curiosity and interest.","Noah gazed up at him, meeting his green eyes.","He gulped down his saliva.","\"You... you really are good at avoiding... to be able to survive this far... not bad, boy... you got talent... but too bad. Today you will die. What did you say before? Kill me if you can? Here... I am so close to killing you...\" Petrick said with a smirk.","The dagger in his right hand was still inside Noah.","His words didn’t make Noah flinch or fear.","Rather, a smile bloomed on his face. It was a charming one since he was too handsome.","Petrick frowned at why this boy was still smiling.","\"Well... you still haven’t killed me... nor you can ever kill me...\"","\"And why is that?\"","Noah kept smiling. He wanted to say that he was a transmigrator. No way he would die so early.","But he didn’t.","\"Why?... you will get to know that soon... thanks for being a talkative villain.\"","Petrick’s frown deepened. Then his instincts screamed. Someone was coming from behind him.","He tried to pull out the dagger that was dug inside Noah’s shoulder.","But to his surprise. Noah grabbed his wrist tightly with both hands. While his dagger and his hand were being covered with ice at high speed.","He tried to pull out, but Noah had grabbed him tightly. His hand froze in ice.","\"Tch!\" Petrick clicked his tongue and swung his left arm, trying to use his left-hand dagger to kill Noah.","But he was late. Someone was already upon him.","A huge figure loomed over him from behind. He swung his weapon at him. Petrick gave up on killing Noah. He ducked down.","The huge battle axe blade slashed above the empty space.","Petrick’s eyes met Noah’s. Since he was kneeling and now Petrick was also ducked. Noah’s right hand left Petrick’s wrist.","His hand clenched into a fist. The be punched Petrick across his left cheek.","\"Garrh!\" Petrick’s face turned to the right side. As a groan left his mouth.","\"You—!\" He turned to look at Noah with anger. But he couldn’t waste his time.","The moment Noah had punched him, Petrick also struck his left-hand dagger at the frozen right hand.","Crack.","Crush.","With a crackling sound, the frozen ice broke from his hand. He pulled out the dagger from Noah’s shoulder. Blood flew with it.","Noah closed his eyes in pain. The pain of dagger taken out from his flesh was more strong.","\"Not so fast.\" A heavy voice came.","Behind him, Draven was ready to strike Petrick with a heavy blow. His battle axe was raised above him. Mana covered the heavy blade of his weapon.","As he brought it down in a clean, heavy vertical slash over Petrick.","Noah used his feet to push himself a few steps back.","BOOM!"]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: First Incident (10)","paragraphs":["BOOM!","The blade of the battle axe struck the","Cobblestone road, shattering the road as debris flew into the air.","Dust from the road spread outward in air.","Petrick was able to dodge the strike.","He sidestepped instantly before the attack could land on him. Just then, a big hammer came toward Petrick.","His dagger met against the flat side of the war hammer.","CLANG!","It was Regnar, who was now using a hammer to fight.","\"Arhh! Fuck this weak body!\" Petrick said in annoyance.","\"So you are the one behind all of this!\" Regnar said in rage. He was really angry about everything that had happened.","Petrick didn’t reply. Instead, he moved forward and clashed directly with Regnar.","CLANG!","CLANG!","CLANG!","The hammer and daggers collided again and again. Sparks flew every time the weapons met.","Regnar suddenly opened his left palm. While he kept hammer in right. A gray color magic circle appeared in front of him. And a strange vibration spread through the air.","[Sound Burst]","A visible ripple formed in the air and shot toward Petrick. The sound wave exploded near him, forcing Petrick to jump back and cover his ears for a brief moment.","But before Petrick could recover, Draven arrived from the side.","His battle axe swung horizontally toward Petrick’s waist.","Petrick bent backward and avoided the blade by inches, then spun and kicked Draven in the side. Draven slid a few steps back but quickly regained his balance.","Now both Draven and Regnar stood side by side.","Regnar tightened his grip on his hammer, while Draven lifted his battle axe and mana began to swirl around the blade. Wind started gathering around his axe, spinning like a small storm.","The wind wrapped around the axe blade, making it sharper and faster.","Both of them attacked at the same time. Regnar swung his hammer downward, while Draven slashed diagonally from the side.","Petrick moved quickly, blocking Regnar’s hammer with one dagger and deflecting Draven’s axe with the other.","CLANG!","CLANG!","Despite fighting two people at once, Petrick was still smiling.","Petrick’s body was being used by someone else. Petrick himself was low level, and the real enemy who was controlling him couldn’t use his own full power or high-level magic spells. All he could rely on was combat experience and skill.","Yet he was handling both young men, Draven and Regnar, very well.","Regnar swung his hammer again, covered with dense mana. It hit heavily against his dagger.","The impact of the attack forced Petrick to step back, but at that same moment Draven appeared behind him and swung his axe vertically.","Wind howled around the blade as it came down.","Petrick rolled forward on the ground, barely avoiding the axe, then kicked Regnar’s knee from below, forcing him to lose balance for a moment. He then threw a quick slash at Draven, cutting his sleeve slightly before jumping back to create distance.","The three of them stood facing each other now.","Meanwhile, Noah watched from some distance, leaning his back against a wall.","His breathing was heavy. His body was covered in cuts and blood.","He slowly took out a mana recovery potion and a healing potion.","He drank the mana recovery potion first, then the healing potion.","Warmth started to fill inside his body.","The core which had felt empty slowly started to fill with mana again.","His expression calmed down as he watched the battle.","The cuts on his body started to mend and heal. The cut on his chest also started to heal, but very slowly since it was big, and the injury on his shoulder was also healing very slowly.","It wouldn’t heal fully since it was a low-level potion.","Noah watched the battle calmly.","Boom!","While he could hear the sound of fighting, it was not in front of him, but somewhere farther away.","The monster Damien and the others were fighting was really strong. Its endurance, in particular, seemed extremely high.","Noah had already done what he wanted to do. He could have simply hidden in some corner of this place, or inside any building, just like many students who were still hiding in different places.","But he didn’t do that. The reason was simple. He wanted to get involved in this incident so he could contribute and receive a nice reward from his broken system... or whatever that thing was.","’...I even fought against the main villain of this arc... or scenario. Whatever it is... now I can just wait for Damien to kill him, and I might get a better reward.’","He exhaled slowly. Many innocent students had died. He had even seen one get killed right in front of him.","Yet... he was somehow handling it well. Maybe it was because such things were normal in this world, and the previous Noah didn’t feel much about it... or maybe the current Noah just had something wrong with his head.","But it didn’t matter. All that mattered was his survival. He continued watching the battle.","Despite Regnar and Draven both fighting together, Petrick was keeping up with them without much problem.","Just then, a huge light came from the direction where Damien and the others were fighting the huge monster behind the buildings.","It brightened the sky.","Noah covered his eyes from the bright light.","Even Petrick and the other two stopped fighting momentarily and looked in that direction.","Soon, a high-pitched loud scream of a monster came from that place. It sounded painful.","SCREEEECHHHHH!!","Then a huge explosion came from there.","BOOOM!","It sent a hot shockwave through the air.","Dust, light, and wind spread everywhere. No one could see what was happening there.","Thud.","Something heavy fell on the ground somewhere away.","Noah thought the battle between Damien and the monster had ended. He sighed in relief, thinking Damien would soon come here.","’ ..it’s finally ended.’","But suddenly.","Petrick put the dagger in his left hand into his waist band and then pulled out something from his storage ring.","It was a pyramid-shaped brown metal object with some runes carved on it.","It started to gleam.","Both Draven and Regnar became tense and got ready to defend themselves, expecting some kind of attack from the object.","But nothing happened. The object stopped shining.","Petrick then crushed the object with his hand and threw it aside. It was looked liked some machine from inside.","Then he raised both daggers again and got ready to fight, a wide smile appearing on his face.","Noah narrowed his eyes.","’Something is not right ..’"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Where Is Damien?","paragraphs":["’Something is not right...’ Noah thought.","He observed his surroundings carefully, but he found nothing obviously wrong.","Everything looked normal. Just like before.","Draven and Regnar were still fighting Petrick.","A blue-colored magic circle formed in front of Regnar. A spear made of dark blue lightning shot toward Petrick at sharp speed.","Petrick dodged it, only to see a battle axe already descending toward him, ready to split him in half. Petrick moved even faster and slashed toward Draven’s stomach, forcing Draven to jump back and avoid the blade.","They continued fighting, and Petrick was slowly managing to injure both of them while smiling as if he was enjoying the battle.","Noah got up while clenching his teeth. Pain was still all over his body. But he was more worried about what was going to happen. The protagonist and his friend still hadn’t come. That made him really worried.","He pulled the fallen spear back into his hand.","Just when he was about to join the battle, he heard something.","\"What?\" He muttered under his breathe.","Noah’s eyes moved toward the direction of the building behind which Damien and the others were fighting.","The sound increased.","It was the sound of growling... like monsters screaming and growling.","Just then, the building walls broke from behind and beside the road, and monsters started coming out.","They were large in number.","Noah’s eyes widened in terror. He couldn’t tell where this many monsters came from.","Just then, his eyes fell on the smiling Petrick.","He understood immediately.","The pyramid-like object was actually something that brought more monsters here.","’That’s what this man had done...damn!’","Noah cursed and dashed toward the incoming monsters.","Draven and Regnar were shocked when they saw the monsters suddenly appearing everywhere.","Salamanders, hobgoblins, and wolf-type monsters. These three types of monsters were coming.","The total number exceeded thirty.","Fear crawled inside Noah, yet he stood his ground. With everything he had, he used his Ice Creation ability.","Three hobgoblins were running in their direction, roaring loudly.","But beneath them, huge spikes of ice suddenly shot out from the ground, bigger and sharper than human size. They pierced through the feet and lower bodies of the hobgoblins brutally. The creatures screamed in pain as their bodies were impaled and pinned to the ground.","They were weaker compared to the lizard-type monsters, and the ice spikes were enough to seriously injure them.","Regnar tried to move toward Noah to help him, but Petrick didn’t let him go.","Petrick attacked him aggressively, forcing Regnar to stay and fight.","Soon, the street was filled with monsters.","Buildings and shops on both sides were destroyed as monsters smashed through walls and windows.","Some monsters ran to the opposite side of the street. Some entered buildings, destroying them further and trying to find other people. While a few came directly toward Noah and the others.","Everything was getting more dangerous and harder. The man man who was controlling petrick also calm and smiling. As if getting hinself killed here was nothing for him.","Four wolf-type beasts ran toward Noah at high speed.","Two of them lunged at him from the front.","Noah sidestepped and thrust his spear directly into the neck of one monster, killing it instantly. At the same time, when another wolf landed on the road, its feet were suddenly covered in ice, freezing them to the ground.","Noah moved forward immediately and thrust his spear into the monster’s forehead, killing it.","But two more wolves lunged at him from two sides.","He was in danger.","Just then, two arrows shot from the air, cutting through the air with a whistling sound, and struck the foreheads of both monsters perfectly.","Those arrows were made up of pure mana.","Both wolves collapsed to the ground instantly.","Noah quickly turned his head toward the direction from where the arrows came.","On top of a broken building, a figure stood.","Her beautiful violet hair sway with wind. In her hand held bow and arrow.","More arrows were already placed between her fingers, ready to shoot again. Her yellow eyes scanning everything.","’Arisha.. She came...that means..’","He looked at straight. Where monster were coming from.","Between them moving two figures. Killing each monster after another.","A young man with huge greatsword that moved easily in hand. Each of his swung were heavy, fast and powerful. Mean to kill his enemies.","He was sweating. Breathing heavily.","Slash!","His sword covered with blazing fire slashed another hobgoblin.","Just few distance away from him was a woman who looked like nothing less that a Valkyrie.","The golden spear in her hand shine with bright color. Light element wrapped around its blade like a scorching heat.","She swung it,thrust, rotating and slashing.","A lizard type monster dashed at her, she move with incredible speed and dodge the claw of monster.","The hot tip of spear cleanly slash its leg.","Blood gushed out. The cut was so deep that monster lost its balanced. Taking the chance the spear thrust inside its neck. Killing it another strike.","While Noah couldn’t just keep watching,","Before he could react, more monsters rushed toward him. Salamanders this time, their bodies glowing slightly red, heat radiating from their skin.","Noah took a deep breath and slammed his hand toward the ground.","A thick wall of ice rose from the ground in front of him. The salamanders crashed into the wall, some of them climbing over it, their claws melting parts of the ice due to their heat.","Mana that he had recovered started to drained very fast. His head throbbed painful. Veins bulge on his forehead.","Exhaustion catching his body rapidly.","He had never used his ability this much before. The strain was caughting him faster.","Yet he didn’t stop. He just couldn’t. He need to fight...until they are not out from here...he need to give his all.","’Fight!...I can’t give up....’","Noah jumped back and created two ice spears in the air beside him. With a wave of his hand.","He sharpened the blades of those spears as much as possible.","Both spears shot forward and pierced into the bodies of two salamanders.","But there were too many monsters.","One hobgoblin jumped toward him from the side, swinging a crude iron club. Noah barely blocked it with his spear.","CLANG!","The impact made his already injured body scream in pain.","\"AARGHHH!!\"","Another wolf ran toward him from behind.","Noah quickly created ice on the ground behind him without even looking. The wolf slipped the moment it stepped on the ice, and Noah turned and stabbed it through the chest.","He was breathing heavily now. The street had turned into complete chaos.","Monsters everywhere. Broken buildings. Fire, ice, dust, and blood.","In the distance, Regnar and Draven were still fighting Petrick, while Noah was holding back a wave of monsters almost alone.","He tightened his grip on his spear, his hands covered in blood and frost.","The involvement of Arisha and others was a huge help.","\"If this continues... we are going to die here...\" he muttered under his breath.","His eyes darted around. ’Others are here... but where is Damien?’"]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: The Fight was Getting Harder","paragraphs":["Everyone who was fighting that huge monster was present here.","But the main protagonist was missing.","BOOM!","\"GAAHH!!\"","Just then, a loud scream came from behind. Noah instantly turned around.","There, Regnar’s body was crushed against a broken wall. A cut ran diagonally across his front.","\"Garrghhh!\" Regnar fell on the road.","Clutching his chest, he pulled out a healing potion and immediately drank it.","Noah turned to see Draven, who had also taken more hits.","Both his arms were filled with cuts.","Petrick’s dark blades of daggers moved faster and more precisely, without any wasted movements.","Noah’s left shoulder was still wounded. The potion didn’t heal his injury completely. The same went for the horizontal cut on his chest.","But it was half healed, so blood was no longer coming out in the same amount as before.","Arisha, who was on a building, came down.","Landing on the road, she ran toward Noah and the others.","While running, she continued to shoot arrows.","Her eyes shone in a golden shade.","That was her ability, which helped her see far away.","She could see perfect trajectories for aiming, detect fatal points on the body, and even notice the faintest movement in the surroundings.","An arrow made up of sharp wind shot toward monsters one after another.","Killing weaker ones in one shot, while stronger ones took heavy damage.","Soon she was closer to Noah.","He remained standing on the street as she came beside him.","She covered for Noah and the others.","She looked in Noah’s direction. \"Go kill that man! I will stop monsters from approaching you guys!\"","Noah nodded. \"Thank you!\"","Noah turned backward and started to run toward Draven and Petrick.","Regnar, who had fallen, also started to run. He came beside Noah.","\"Let’s kill that bastard!\"","Noah glanced at his side while running. \"Are you okay? Can you fight?\"","\"Of course I can. I am not going down until we kill him.\"","His hammer glowed in a dark blue hue, showing he was using mana on it.","\"That’s the spirit.\"","\"Argggh!\"","Draven fell on his knees.","A deep slash had struck his left knee.","Petrick was about to strike his dagger into his neck to kill him.","\"You can’t!\"","The tiger beastman jumped high, directly toward Petrick.","His hammer rose up in the air to strike hard with all he got.","Petrick didn’t stop. His dagger had already swung with incredible speed.","But Draven was not weak by any means.","He threw his body backward as his back touched the cobblestone road.","The dagger met empty space.","From above, Regnar came down with a heavy swing of his hammer coated with dense mana.","\"Take this, you bastard!\"","Petrick moved his other hand in time and blocked it with a dagger.","But the force was too strong, which sent Petrick’s body flying back.","\"Gahh!\" He fell on the road with a groan. He rolled a few times and got up.","Only to see a spear coming in his direction at blinding speed, cutting the air with a whistling sound.","\"Shiit!\" Petrick cursed and crossed his daggers.","The spearhead clashed against the daggers.","CLANG!","Once again he was pushed back.","Noah came and stood beside Regnar, who was helping Draven to get up.","A few meters away from them, Petrick stood up. Blood was leaking from his mouth and broken lips.","Spit!","He spat some blood out of his mouth onto the road.","Behind Noah and the others, Arisha, Leonard, and Lyria were fighting and killing monsters.","Their cries filled the surroundings.","Petrick smirked and looked at the trio.","\"You are three... yet you are not able to kill me... how weak you guys are... this body I am using is so weak that I couldn’t use my true powers, yet here you are... struggling to survive. How weak students does this academy nurture?\" he said in a mocking tone.","Which made both Draven and Regnar growl in anger.","\"I swear we won’t let you go alive today..\"","\"I will kill you.\"","Both of them burst out.","Draven lifted his battle axe, Regnar raised his hammer.","\"Guys, calm down... don’t lose control of your emotions..\"","Noah pulled his spear from the ground. He gripped the shaft tightly.","\"Let’s kill this bastard this time.\"","\"Yeah!\"","This time, the three of them dashed toward Petrick.","They circled him from three sides and swung their weapons at him.","Draven had a deep injury on his knee, yet he was pushing himself to fight.","Regnar also had a slash on his front which was not fully healed, yet he fought with determination.","Noah, who was also injured, continued to support them.","Petrick blocked all three attacks almost instantly. His daggers moved like black flashes, parrying spear, axe, and hammer one after another without wasting a single movement.","Draven attacked from the left with a heavy horizontal swing of his battle axe. Regnar followed with a downward smash of his hammer, while Noah thrust his spear straight toward Petrick’s chest.","Yet Petrick avoided them.","The fight continued.","---","Away from them,","Leonard, Lyria, and Arisha tried their best to kill as many monsters as possible.","Leonard was moving through the monsters.","His greatsword was now covered with dense mana. The blue mana particles gave his blade a pure hue. As he swung it horizontally, an arc of pure mana shot forward.","The azure slash was thick; it was meant to destroy rather than cut.","BOOM!","The moment that arc touched the two wolf-type monsters, it exploded.","The monsters were dead from a single attack.","While Lyria stayed some distance behind, killing slightly stronger monsters. And from behind, Arisha supported with arrows and magic spells.","Lyria killed another monster and stepped back.","Turning toward Arisha, she asked, \"Where did you take Damien?\" Lyria asked with ragged breathing. She was tired. She was also reaching her limits.","Arisha, who had just released an arrow made up of pure mana, cut through the air and then divided into five arrows.","Each of them tore into different monsters, at their necks, at their eyes, or other weak points.","She looked at Lyria and said, \"I took him inside that building.\" She pointed at the building on the right side of the road, on which she was standing and covering Noah.","\"How is he?\" Lyria asked while panting.","Still, she started to cover her spear with mana.","The blue mana particles that covered her spear blade soon started to take the form of white light.","Heat radiated from the tip.","\"He is okay... but it will take time to recover... he said it will take a few more minutes for him to be able to use mana again.\"","\"Damn... the side effect of his ability is really bad.\" Lyria shook her head in worry.","She shot forward, left foot in front.","She thrust her spear straight toward the huge lizard monster who was ready to throw flame at her with its mouth open.","The thrust of her spear released three white spears made up of white light toward the monster.","They were so fast that before the monster could throw flame at her, one light spear perfectly struck inside its mouth.","One at its leg, while another at its neck side.","CREEEECH!!","The monster screamed in pain. The spear that struck inside its mouth reacted with the flame forming inside, and they exploded.","The head of the monster burst into particles."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Near Death","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, the road that led toward the main building of the Academy.","At one particular place, just before the stopping streets ended, many students were gathered.","They were nearly half a kilometer away from Noah and the others. The area was huge and widespread.","Unfortunately, they were stuck.","From one point, they couldn’t go forward. An invisible barrier was blocking them.","Most of the students were first-years, while a few among them were second-years.","They were fighting together.","BOOM!","The monsters were in small numbers at first. But suddenly, a horde of monsters came in their direction. More than thirty monsters were in that horde.","Or maybe more.","Spells were cast, weapons moved, and different attacks were thrown at the monsters.","The students tried their best to survive.","---","Back to Noah and others,","CLACK!","Noah pushed the dagger aside and swung the butt of his spear toward Petrick’s face. Petrick leaned back and avoided it by inches, then slashed Noah across the arm.","A thin cut opened and blood flowed out.","Noah gritted his teeth but didn’t step back.","Regnar roared and swung his hammer again, this time from the side. The hammer was coated in dense blue mana, making it heavier and more destructive.","Petrick jumped back to avoid the strike.","BOOM!","The hammer smashed into the road, breaking stones and sending debris flying.","Draven, despite his injured knee, forced himself forward and swung his axe diagonally upward.","Wind mana gathered around the blade again, making a sharp whistling sound as it cut through the air.","Petrick blocked it, but this time the impact pushed him back several steps.","The three of them didn’t stop.","They attacked again and again, not giving Petrick even a second to breathe.","Noah created two small ice spikes in the air and launched them toward Petrick while thrusting his spear again. Petrick deflected one spike, dodged the other, and blocked the spear, but at that same moment Regnar’s hammer came from above again.","Petrick rolled forward to avoid the hammer, but Draven was already there and kicked Petrick in the side, pushing him off balance.","For the first time, Petrick lost his footing slightly.","Noah saw that opening.","He gathered mana into his spear and thrust forward with all his strength.","The spear shot forward like a bolt.","Petrick barely moved his body aside, and the spear pierced through his shoulder instead of his chest.","\"GHH—!\" Petrick groaned for the first time.","\"Tch! This is for giving me a wound... on the same place.\"","Petrick grabbed the shaft with his hand and kicked Noah in the stomach.","\"UGH!\"","Noah was pushed back, losing his grip on the spear. The spear remained stuck in Petrick’s shoulder.","Finally, Petrick had stopped laughing. His expression was cold and dangerous.","His once emerald eyes started to turn black.","\"This is enough... I don’t have much time now... let me kill all of you before going.\"","Petrick’s body started to glow in dark black color.","A shockwave shot outward from his body. The spear fell from his shoulder.","He stuck both daggers in his waistband.","A huge magic circle appeared above his two empty palms.","The trio watched tensely.","\"Whatever he is trying... it’s not good. Attack him. Don’t let him continue.\"","’Is he getting power up? Shitt! Then why did he fight with use without using powerful form.’ Noah thought with annoyance.","The black magic circle floated in the air, then shot toward his own body. It touched against his skin and slipped inside his body.","\"Gahh!\" He groaned.","Suddenly Petrick vanished from his place and appeared in front of Draven.","His fist collided against Draven’s chest.","\"ARGH!!\"","Draven’s huge heavy body was shot through the air by that punch.","Regnar and Noah, who were beside Draven, were shocked.","Next, Petrick appeared in front of Regnar. This time he took out his dagger and slashed it at Regnar’s neck.","Regnar ducked down in time.","But from below he was struck by a heavy kick.","While the dagger which missed his neck slashed down on his back.","Slashed!","\"ARGHH!\"","Regnar didn’t even get the chance to react properly.","Petrick grabbed the back of his coat and pulled the dagger out from his back in one brutal motion. Blood splattered onto the ground.","Regnar roared in pain, but before he could swing his hammer, Petrick kicked him hard in the stomach.","BOOM!","Regnar’s huge body was thrown several meters away and crashed into the side of a tree. He tried to stand up, but his injured back and the heavy kick made him collapse to one knee.","Petrick didn’t even look at him again. His cold black eyes moved toward Noah. He slowly started walking toward him.","Noah stood there, breathing heavily, already injured, exhausted, and now weaponless since his spear was still stuck in Petrick’s shoulder earlier and had fallen somewhere during the chaos.","Petrick cracked his neck slightly and said in a cold voice, \"You wanted me to kill you... now take this.\"","Before Noah could react,","Petrick suddenly appeared in front of him and punched him straight in the ribs.","CRACK!","Noah’s eyes widened as the sound of bones breaking echoed in his ears.","\"UGHHH!!\"","He coughed blood immediately.","But Petrick didn’t stop.","He grabbed Noah by the collar and slammed his knee into Noah’s stomach. Then he slashed his dagger across Noah’s left arm.","SLASH!","Blood sprayed into the air.","Noah tried to punch him, but Petrick caught his fist easily and twisted his arm, then kicked him again in the chest.","BOOM!","Noah’s body was thrown through the air and smashed into the wall of a nearby building.","The wall cracked on impact, and Noah fell to the ground, barely able to move. His vision was blurry, his ribs were broken, his arm was bleeding heavily, and he could barely breathe.","Petrick slowly walked toward him, spinning the dagger in his hand.","\"This is the end,\" he said coldly.","He raised the dagger and dashed forward to stab Noah through the heart.","His death was near.","But suddenly,","A figure jumped down from the second floor of the nearby building.","Petrick sensed it instantly and immediately changed the trajectory of his dagger.","CLANG!","Sparks flew as the dagger collided with a sword mid-air.","The impact pushed both of them slightly back.","Petrick landed on the ground and quickly stepped away, creating distance between them. His black eyes narrowed as he looked at the person who had blocked his attack.","A young man stood in front of Noah.","He had black hair and sharp hazel eyes. He held a sword firmly in his hand, standing between Petrick and Noah like a wall.","His expression was calm, but his eyes were cold.","He slowly pointed his sword toward Petrick and said,","\"You’ve done enough.\"","He was Damien."]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: End Of The First Incident (1)","paragraphs":["Petrick stared at him cautiously, sensing the mana flowing around the young man’s body.","With a cold smile, Petrick said, \"...So you actually came... Damien.\"","The young man didn’t reply immediately. He simply adjusted his grip on the sword and took a step forward.","With a cold expression, Damien asked, \"It seems you know me. Let me ask you... who are you? And why did you do all this?\"","His hazel eyes pierced into Petrick’s now black eyes.","Petrick didn’t back down; instead, he giggled. With a mocking expression, he said, \"Why do you need to know? When you are going to die?\" He held the daggers firmly.","Damien didn’t feel intimidated by him. With the same confident voice, he continued, \"Was there really any reason for you to kill so many students? What have they done to you? What animosity did you have towards them... towards us?\"","Behind him, Noah struggled to stay conscious, his vision fading, but he could still see the back of the man who had just saved his life.","Petrick smirked and said, \"Oh boy... you are mistaking something here... I didn’t come here because I had some ulterior motive or animosity against anyone.\"","Damien’s expression turned angry as he raised his voice. \"Then why are you here?!\"","Petrick chuckled and said, \"I do not find any reason to tell you. Hehe.\"","He got ready to attack Damien.","Damien also raised his sword to fight.","Just then, a blue line formed in the air, moving in the direction of Petrick. An arrow shot at Petrick from afar, and he slashed it with his dagger.","Suddenly Draven closed the distance with him and attacked Petrick from behind.","The huge battle axe swung horizontally to bisect him.","With an annoyed expression, Petrick said, \"Tch! Annoying pests!\"","Petrick jumped high and dodged the strike. From his left, a lightning spear came with a crackling sound. It was a spell shot by Regnar.","Both Regnar and Draven hadn’t given up yet. They were still willing to fight.","While Arisha had come and was attacking the man from some distance away, protecting both Regnar and Draven from fatal attacks.","Watching that Arisha had joined in, Damien exhaled a deep breath. He let the three handle this for a while and turned to Noah.","Noah shook his head a few times so he could keep himself awake. Then he slowly pushed himself up onto his feet.","Damien helped him to stand.","With ragged breathing, Noah said, \"Th-Thanks, Damien... for helping me in time.\"","To which Damien simply replied calmly, \"No problem. I did what was right.\"","Noah looked toward Petrick, who was beating Draven and Regnar easily, and said with anger, \"Now... go kill that bastard... he killed so many people.\"","Damien’s expression hardened. \"Noah... the thing is... I cannot use my mana for a while. Because I used my ability. It’s a side effect of that. Even my body is strained and exhausted. Stopping that heavy strike of that man to save you was too hard for me to handle.\"","Noah’s eyes widened in shock.","\"You...\"","Now Noah remembered the bright light coming from that side.","’So it was him using his ability... in the character list it was actually written that he had side effects after using his ability. Damn! So he used his ability... and now he cannot fight Petrick,’ Noah thought gravely.","His bloodied mouth clenched.","\"Damn!.. we need help from others then...\"","Damien looked toward the battlefield and said, \"They seem busy fighting monsters... we need to kill that man ourselves.\"","Noah looked at him and asked, \"Can you fight him physically?\"","Damien grimaced, then nodded. \"I could try... it’s risky.\"","Noah rubbed his forehead, trying to think of a way to kill that man.","Then he shook his head.","\"Okay... I guess... we could try that...\"","Damien frowned slightly. \"What try?\"","\"Well... it’s sloppy... and very low chance to succeed...\"","Damien spoke seriously, \"It doesn’t matter... just tell me.\"","Noah then explained, \"Firstly... you guys need to hold Petrick for a while. It seems he is burning his life force to use more power. But I think with how much strength he is using... it might take fifteen to twenty minutes for him to exhaust his life force.\"","Then Noah told him the simple plan in short.","Damien looked at him with some doubt and asked, \"You... so you really think you can do it?\"","Noah leaned his back against the wall for support and said, \"Yes... I can do it.\"","Damien looked at him and asked, \"Why do you believe so much that you can do it?\"","Noah clenched his teeth and said, \"Because I really want to kill that man... no matter what... even if it doesn’t kill him really.\"","Damien nodded. \"Okay... I will tell this to Regnar. Get ready for it... as fast as possible. And give me a sign.\"","Noah nodded. \"Thanks for believing in me,\" he said tiredly, still trying to keep himself up.","His body was in too much pain. Blood was still coming out from his wounds.","Ribs broken inside. Bruises all over his body.","Damien then said seriously, \"We have to do... whatever will help us to get out.\"","Damien turned and slowly moved toward the fight. With his sword raised, he started to run toward Petrick.","Noah pulled something out from his storage ring.","It was a scroll. The one given by Instructor Morgana to learn magic spells from it.","The spell was simple and easy. But now learning it in one go was truly hard.","He opened the scroll and saw the magic spell pattern.","He held it with his left hand and put his right palm on it. His mana started to flow inside the scroll slowly.","The mana particles from his body moved through the spell slowly, following the lines of the pattern.","Noah observed them, he studied them, he tried to memorize the structure and pathways. He tried it multiple times.","It was hard. The flow trembled from time to time. Not going stable and perfect.","It was harder than Noah initially thought.","But he got the basic idea about the spell.","He remembered the structure of the magic circle perfectly.","What he didn’t know was at what speed, intensity, and in what amount mana should be supplied.","He also didn’t know how to keep it stable when he had never truly practiced it before.","But none of that mattered.","He would succeed, no matter what.","’Now it’s time to kill that bastrad.’","He moved toward the fight."]}]);
